(77,'widget_text','a:8:{i:8;a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"About Us\";s:4:\"text\";s:148:\"Nulla vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue. Nulla vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue. Nulla vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue. Donec sed odio dui.\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;}i:10;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:561:\"[gdlr_widget_box title=\"Get a Question?\" title-color=\"#ffffff\" background=\"https://demo.goodlayers.com/traveltour/main4/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/widget-bg-1.jpg\" color=\"#c9e2ff\" ]\r\nDo not hesitage to give us a call. We are an expert team and we are happy to talk to you.\r\n\r\n[gdlr_core_icon icon=\"fa fa-phone\" size=\"17px\" color=\"#ffcf2a\" margin-right=\"10px\" ] <span style=\"font-size: 17px; color: #ffcf2a; font-weight: 600;\">1.8445.3356.33</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #fff; font-weight: 600;\">Help@goodlayers.com</span>\r\n\r\n[/gdlr_widget_box]\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:6:\"visual\";b:0;}i:12;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:708:\"[gdlr_core_space height=\"-10px\"]\r\n[gdlr_widget_box title=\"Got a Question?\" title-color=\"#ffffff\" background=\"https://travlio.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/widget-bg-a2.jpg\" color=\"#528dbf\" padding=\" 50px 40px 30px 40px\" ]\r\n[gdlr_core_icon icon=\"fa fa-phone\" size=\"24px\" color=\"#ffe786\" margin-right=\"10px\" ] <span style=\"font-size: 28px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600;\"><a href=\"tel:08336908118\">+91 98312 34910\r\n</a></span>\r\n[gdlr_core_space height=\"-15px\"]\r\n[gdlr_core_icon icon=\"fa fa-envelope-o\" size=\"20px\" color=\"#ffe786\" margin-right=\"10px\" ] <span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #fff; font-weight: 600;\"><a href=\"mailto:subrata.ash@gmail.com\">subrata.ash@gmail.com</a></span>\r\n\r\n[/gdlr_widget_box]\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:6:\"visual\";b:0;}i:13;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:383:\"[gdlr_core_space height=\"-10px\"]\r\n\r\n[gdlr_widget_box title=\"Pay Safely With Us\" title-color=\"#ffffff\" background=\"#373737\" left-ico