iry}\n\n\";s:18:\"enquiry-mail-title\";s:29:\"You have submitted an enquiry\";s:20:\"enquiry-mail-content\";s:178:\"Dear {full-name},\n\nYou have sumiited an enquiry from {tour-name}\n\nMessage: {your-enquiry}\n\nOur team will contact you back via the email you provided, {email-address} \n\nThank you!\";s:26:\"tour-search-item-num-fetch\";s:1:\"4\";s:18:\"enable-tour-schema\";s:7:\"disable\";s:26:\"tour-schema-price-currency\";s:3:\"₹\";s:27:\"tour-header-overlay-opacity\";s:2:\"15\";s:24:\"max-dropdown-room-amount\";s:0:\"\";s:24:\"price-thousand-separator\";s:1:\",\";s:23:\"price-decimal-separator\";s:1:\".\";s:21:\"included-tax-in-price\";s:7:\"disable\";s:16:\"enable-recaptcha\";s:7:\"disable\";s:17:\"enable-membership\";s:7:\"disable\";s:17:\"mobile-login-link\";s:7:\"disable\";s:17:\"block-seat-status\";s:4:\"book\";s:21:\"contact-detail-fields\";s:0:\"\";s:27:\"additional-traveller-fields\";s:131:\"{slug=age,title=Age,type=combobox,options=12-15/15-18/18+ 20,width=50%}\n{slug=phone,title=Phone,type=text,required=true,width=50%}\n\";s:17:\"search-page-style\";s:7:\"style-2\";s:19:\"search-month-amount\";s:2:\"12\";s:25:\"tour-search-default-style\";s:4:\"list\";s:42:\"tour-search-order-filterer-grid-style-type\";s:7:\"style-2\";s:24:\"invoice-customer-address\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"single-tour-style\";s:7:\"style-2\";s:24:\"mobile-content-read-more\";s:6:\"enable\";s:27:\"mobile-booking-bar-position\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:27:\"single-tour-header-gradient\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:29:\"single-tour-top-gradient-size\";s:5:\"154px\";s:32:\"single-tour-bottom-gradient-size\";s:5:\"291px\";s:19:\"update-header-price\";s:7:\"disable\";s:26:\"require-adult-to-book-tour\";s:7:\"disable\";s:32:\"admin-registration-email-address\";s:22:\"contact@goodlayers.com\";s:39:\"enable-admin-registration-complete-mail\";s:7:\"disable\";s:38:\"admin-registration-complete-mail-title\";s:21:\"New user registration\";s:32:\"admin-registration-complete-mail\";s:194:\"<strong>Dear Admin,</strong> \n N