 in this spot, which was created for the bliss of souls like mine. I am so happy, my dear friend, so absorbed in the exquisite.\";}}s:6:\"active\";s:1:\"1\";s:22:\"allow-closing-all-tabs\";s:7:\"disable\";s:5:\"style\";s:8:\"box-icon\";s:5:\"align\";s:4:\"left\";s:13:\"icon-position\";s:4:\"left\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"30px\";s:15:\"title-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"title-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"title-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"title-text-transform\";s:7:\"default\";}}}}}'),
