:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:6022:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata</h2><h3>Destinations covered </h3><h4>London</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour</li><li>Visit to Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</li><li>Ride on the London Eye</li></ul><h4>Paris</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour </li><li>Visit 2nd level of the Eiffel Tower </li><li>Visit Disneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park)</li><li>Enjoy the Illumination Tour of Paris</li></ul><h4>Belgium</h4><ul><li>Visit the Mini Europe </li><li>Orientation tour of Brussels</li></ul><h4>Netherlands</h4><ul><li>Enjoy the Amsterdam Canal cruise</li><li>Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May)</li><li>Visit Volendam (From 13th May)</li><li>Visit a cheese farm and a wooden shoe workshop (From 13th May)</li></ul><h4>Germany</h4><ul><li>Visit the Cologne Cathedral</li><li>Enjoy the River Rhine cruise </li><li>Visit the Black Forest</li></ul><h4>Switzerland</h4><ul><li>View the Rhine Falls</li><li>Visit Mt. Titlis </li><li>Orientation tour of Lucerne</li></ul><h4>Austria</h4><ul><li>Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and shop</li><li>Orientation tour of Innsbruck</li></ul><h4>Italy - Venice</h4><ul><li>Visit St. Mark’s Square on a private boat</li></ul><h4>Florence</h4><ul><li>Guided Walking Tour</li></ul><h4>Rome</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour</li></ul><h4>Vatican City</h4><ul><li>Visit the Vatican Museum and Sistine Chapel.</li><li>Visit the St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</li></ul><h4>Pisa</h4><ul><li>Visit the Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</li></ul><h4>Mediterranean Cruise</h4><ul><li>Visit Marseille, France.</li><li>Visit Barcelona, Spain.</li><li>All included On-board amenities such as International Shows, Live Music, and more.</li></ul><h4>Accommodation  </h4><ul><li>02 nights in London, United Kingdom, at Hotel Courtyard by Marriott LHR / Crown Plaza LHR / Radisson LHR or similar places. </li><li>02 nights in Paris, France, at Hotel Millennium Hotel Paris CDG / Novotel Orly / Mercure CDG or similar lodging.  </li><li>02 nights in Belgium / Netherlands, at Hotel Holiday Inn / Van der Valk / NH Konningshof or similar places. </li><li>01 night in Germany, at Hotel Intercity Frankfurt / Best Western Frankfurt or similar lodging. </li><li>03 nights in Switzerland, at Hotel Central / Terrace or similar lodging. </li><li>01 night in Innsbruck / Seefeld, Austria, at Hotel Alp / Alpenkoning or similar lodging. </li><li>01 night in Ferrara / Padova, Italy, at Hotel Astra / AC by Marriott Padova or similar places. </li><li>02 nights in Chianciano Terme, Italy, at Hotel Grand Fonti/ Excelsior/ Fortuna or similar lodging.</li><li>04 nights on a Costa Cruise in an Inside cabin.</li></ul><h4>Meals</h4><ul><li>Daily continental buffet breakfast including bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits. </li><li>08 Indian Jain / vegetarian / nonvegetarian lunches. </li><li>01 Local Lunch. </li><li>14 Indian Jain /vegetarian / non-vegetarian dinners. </li><li>Meals on board as per the Cruise Itinerary. </li><li>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian. </li></ul><h4>Tour inclusions </h4><ul><li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.  </li><li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li><li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.  </li><li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</li><li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. </li><li>Services of a professional, friendly, and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers). </li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date. </li><li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li><li>Mandatory Gratuities on the Cruise of EURO 11 per person per night. For the entire duration of this specific cruise, which is 4 nights, the total Gratuities amount is estimated to be EUR 44 per person which is to be paid at the exact time of boarding our cruise.  </li><li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000. </li><li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</li><li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges. </li><li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included. </li><li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li><li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li><li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li><li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded. </li></ul><h4>Visa requirements </h4><ul><li>Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour. </li><li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.  </li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
