:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:3985:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata. </h2><h3>Destinations Covered </h3><h4>United Kingdom</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour of London</li><li>Entrance to Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</li><li>Ride on the London Eye </li></ul><h4>France</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour of Paris</li><li>Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower</li><li>Visit Fragonard – French Perfume Museum</li><li>Illumination Tour of Paris </li><li>Seine river cruise</li><li>Visit Disneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park) </li></ul><h4>Switzerland</h4><ul><li>Visit Glacier 3000 </li><li>Ride on the Scenic Golden Pass Train</li><li>Orientation tour of Geneva</li><li>Orientation Tour of Gstaad</li><li>Orientation tour of Montreux</li><li>Orientation tour of Lucerne</li><li>Cruise on Lake Lucerne</li><li>Visit Lindt Home of Chocolate</li></ul><h4>Accommodation</h4><ul><li>02 nights in <strong>London (Heathrow Area), United Kingdom</strong> at Hotel Courtyard by Marriott LHR / Radisson LHR / Crown Plaza LHR or similar lodging.</li><li>03 nights in <strong>Paris (CDG Area), France </strong>at Hotel Zenitude CDG / Suite Novotel CDG or similar places. </li><li>02 Nights in <strong>Leysin / Sion / Lausanne, Switzerland</strong> at Hotel Alpine Classic / Moxy or similar lodging. </li><li>02 Nights in <strong>Zurich, Switzerland</strong> at Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe or similar places. </li></ul><h4>Meals</h4><ul><li>Daily Continental Breakfast includes Bread with Butter, Jam, Cereals, Juice, Milk &amp; Coffee. </li><li>04 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Lunches. </li><li>09 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Dinners. <br /><strong><em>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian. </em></strong></li></ul><h4>Tour inclusions</h4><ul><li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.  </li><li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li><li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.  </li><li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</li><li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. </li><li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers). </li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions</h4><ul><li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date. </li><li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000. </li><li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023). </li><li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges. </li><li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included. </li><li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li><li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li><li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li><li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded. </li></ul><h4>Visa requirements</h4><ul><li>Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour. </li><li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
