"none\";s:13:\"icon-position\";s:4:\"left\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:7:\"#1d57ba\";s:21:\"icon-background-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"content-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"caption-color\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"border-color\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"22px\";s:12:\"content-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"caption-size\";s:4:\"14px\";s:19:\"caption-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"caption-text-transform\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"caption-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"image-max-width\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"icon-top-margin\";s:3:\"0px\";s:17:\"icon-right-margin\";s:4:\"18px\";s:18:\"list-bottom-margin\";s:4:\"20px\";s:14:\"item-max-width\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"30px\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:6131:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2><h3>Destinations Covered</h3><p> </p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Srinagar (1 night) </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pahalgam (2 nights) </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gulmarg (1 night) </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Srinagar (2 nights) </span></li></ul><h4>Tour inclusions</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Breakfast </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">05 Complimentary Dinner</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Romantic Hi Tea On the lake (Kashmiri Kahwa With vegetables Pakora)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Kashmiri lunch on the lake.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Romantic Candle light dinner With Cake On the Lake</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Romantic lunch at river side – Pahalgam</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kashmir Apple Juice on way to Pahalgam</span></li></ul><h4>Experience Or Activity</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Romantic Late Evening Shikara Ride on Dal Lake with cake (it gets more attractive during Moon night )</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Candid photoshoot session</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gondola ride (Phase - 1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entrance or Entry tickets</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Betab &amp; Aru Valley<br /></span><strong>Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as it is an additional sightseeing in our itinerary. </strong></li></ul><h4>All transfers and sightseeing</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private Chauffeur Driven Vehicle</span></li></ul><h4>Travel Insurance</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance Included (for age below 69yrs) </span></li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any Air or Rail fare.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other meal not mentioned in price includes.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other destination not mentioned in itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any monument entrance fees, camera fees, guide charges.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of personal nature.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4>Itinerary </h4><h4>Day 1 - Arrival in Srinagar </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing in Srinagar </span></li></ul><h4>Day 2 - Srinagar to Pahalgam journey </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and locality visit during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 3 - Pahalgam </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Locality visit and exploration </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 4 - Pahalgam to Gulmarg journey </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included</span></li></ul><h4>Day 5 - Gulmarg to Srinagar journey </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included</span></li></ul><h4>Day 6 - Day Excursion to Sonmarg  </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Excursion of Sonmarg </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included</span></li></ul><h4>Day 7 - Departure from Srinagar </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flight transfers </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included </span></li></ul><h4>Meals<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Breakfast</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">05 Complimentary Dinner</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Romantic Hi Tea On the lake (Kashmiri Kahwa With vegetables Pakora)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Kashmiri lunch on the lake </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Romantic Candle light dinner With Cake On the Lake</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Romantic lunch at river side – Pahalgam</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kashmir Apple Juice on way to Pahalgam </span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left