:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:5074:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2><h3>Destinations Covered</h3><p> </p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leh (2 nights) </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hanle (2 nights) </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tso Moriri (1 night) </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leh (1 night) </span></li></ul><h4>Tour inclusions</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Accommodation in Twin/Double sharing basis in Starting Room category at each place</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">06 breakfasts and 06 dinners</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Transportation by NAC Xylo / Scorpio / Innova (as per availability) for arrival / departure transfers, sightseeing as per the itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Assistance at the airport while arriving and departing.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Oxygen Cylinder in each vehicle while travelling to Nubra/ Pangong Only</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance (for age below 69yrs).<br /></span><strong>Mics. charges are inclusive like</strong></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ladakh Royalty Fee.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Inner-line permits</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Potareges at hotel and airport</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All applicable luxury/ road taxes </span></li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST will be applicable as per prevailing rates.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Airfares trainfare.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any monastery entrance fees, Any Joy ride or rafting.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Medical expenses (apart from first aid) and insurance of any kind.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips, laundry, liquors, wines, mineral water, telephone charges, camera fee and items of personal nature.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Transportation is not on disposal basis. It is strictly as per the programme, any extra running will be charges extra.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses arising out of unforeseen circumstances like flight delay / cancellation / hike in fare, strike or any other natural calamities or any emergency evacuation expenses.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other item not mentioned in the cost includes section.</span></li></ul><p><strong>Note: Supplement for English Speaking Local Guide (optional): Rs. 3000.00 per day</strong></p><h4>Itinerary </h4><h4>Day 1 - Arrive at Leh </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 2 - Spituk, Magnetic Hill, Gurudwara Pathar Sahib, Sangam &amp; Shanti Stupa </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and excursion of the locality  </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included  </span></li></ul><h4>Day 3 - Leh to Chumathang, Nyoma Loma, Hanle</h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and excursion of the locality  </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 4 - Hanle to Umlingla Pass Excursion</h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and excursion of the locality  </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 5 - Hanle to Mahey and Tsomoriri </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and excursion of the locality  </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 6 - Tsomoriri to Leh</h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and excursion of the locality  </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h5>Day 7 - Departure From Leh </h5><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included </span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
