:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:6022:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2><h3>Destinations Covered</h3><p> </p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leh (2 nights) </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nubra valley (1 night) </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leh (3 nights) </span></li></ul><h4>Tour inclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Accommodation in Twin/Double sharing basis in Starting Room category at each place</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">06 breakfasts and 06 dinners</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Transportation by NAC Xylo / Scorpio / Innova (1 to 6 pax) &amp; Non Ac Tempo Trv (7 to 12 pax) (as per availability) for arrival / departure transfers, sightseeing as per the itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Assistance at the airport while arriving and departing.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Oxygen Cylinder in each vehicle while travelling to Nubra/ Pangong only.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance (for age below 69yrs). </span></li></ul><h4>Mics. charges are inclusive like: </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ladakh Royalty Fee.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Inner-line permits</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Potareges at hotel and airport</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All applicable luxury/ road taxes </span></li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST will be applicable as per prevailing rates.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Airfares and train fare.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any monastery entrance fees, Any Joy ride or rafting.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Medical expenses (apart from first aid) and insurance of any kind.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips, laundry, liquors, wines, mineral water, telephone charges, camera fee and items of personal nature.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Transportation is not on disposal basis. It is strictly as per the programme, any extra running will be charges extra.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses arising out of unforeseen circumstances like flight delay / cancellation / hike in fare, strike or any other natural calamities or any emergency evacuation expenses.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other item not mentioned in the cost includes section.</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Supplement for English Speaking Local Guide (optional): Rs. 3000.00 per day. </span></p><h4>Itinerary </h4><h4>Day 1 - Arrival at Leh </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner included</span></li></ul><h4>Day 2 - Monastery tour and Leh sightseeing </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thiksey Gompa </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shey Palace And Gompa </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Donkey Sanctuary </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leh  Palace </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shanti Stupa (Japanese Peace Pagoda) </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 3 - Leh to Nubra Via Khardungla Pass </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Khardungla Pass </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Deskit Village </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Deskit Gompa </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hundar Village </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 4 - Nubra to Leh</h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Jokhang </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leh Mosque </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 5 - Sightseeing around Leh </h4><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ladakh Hall Of Fame </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spituk Gompa </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Magnetic Hill </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gurdwara Shri Patthar Sahib </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Confluence Of The Zanskar and Indus </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h4>Day 6 - Excursion to Pangong Lake </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing at the Pangong Lake </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 7 - Airport Departure</h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included </span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
