:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:10253:\"<h2>Departure city : Kolkata </h2><h3>Destinations covered </h3><h4><b>London</b></h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit to Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ride on the London Eye</span></li></ul><h4><b>Paris</b></h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided tour of Versailles Palace</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Montmartre</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy Illumination Tour of Paris</span></li></ul><h4>Belgium</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mini Europe </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Brussels </span></li></ul><h4>Netherlands</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy Amsterdam canal cruise</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Volendam (From 13th May)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit a cheese farm and a wooden shoe workshop (From 13th May)</span></li></ul><h4>Germany</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Cologne Cathedral</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy River Rhine cruise</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Black Forest</span></li></ul><h4>Switzerland</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">View the Rhine Falls</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Mt. Titlis </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Lucerne </span></li></ul><h4>Austria</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and shop</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation tour of Innsbruck</span></li></ul><h4>Italy - Venice</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit St. Mark’s square on a private boat</span></li></ul><h4>Florence</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided walking tour</span></li></ul><h4>Rome</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Guided city tour</span></li></ul><h4>Vatican City</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Vatican Museum and Sistine Chapel</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</span></li></ul><h4>Pisa</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the Field of Miracles - See the Leaning Tower of Pisa </span></li></ul><h4>Accommodation</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in London, United Kingdom, at Hotel Courtyard by Marriott LHR / Crown Plaza LHR / Radisson LHR or similar lodging. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Paris, France, at Hotel Millenium CDG / Novotel Orly / Mercure CDG or similar lodging.  </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Belgium / Netherlands, at Hotel Holiday Inn / Van der Valk/ NH or similar lodging. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Germany, at Hotel Intercity Frankfurt / Best Western Frankfurt or similar lodging. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03 nights in Switzerland, at Hotel Central / Terrace or similar lodging. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Innsbruck / Seefeld, Austria, at Hotel Alp / Alpenkoning or similar places. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 night in Ferrara / Padova, Italy, at Hotel Astra / AC by Marriott Padova or similar lodging.  </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">02 nights in Chianciano Terme, Italy, at Hotel Grand Fonti/ Excelsior/ Fortuna or similar lodging.</span></li></ul><h4>Meals</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily continental buffet breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">08 Indian Jain - vegetarian - non-vegetarian lunches.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">14 Indian Jain - vegetarian - non-vegetarian dinners.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Local Lunch. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Note: Packed lunches, only if applicable, will be Jain - vegetarian. <br /></span><b>L: Lunch | D: Dinner | PL: Packed Lunch | PD: Packed Dinner | LL: Local Lunch | LD: Local Dinner </b></li></ul><h4>Tour inclusions</h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.  </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.  </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines mentioned above of the tour.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Services of a professional, friendly, and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).  </span></li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded. </span></li></ul><h4>Visa requirements  </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.  </span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s