:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:5476:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata. </h2><h3>Destinations covered </h3><h4>London</h4><ul><li>Guided City Tour </li><li>Visit Tower of London – see the famous Kohinoor Diamond </li><li>Visit Madame Tussauds</li><li>Ride on the London Eye</li><li>London to Paris by Eurostar </li></ul><h4>Paris</h4><ul><li>Guided City Tour </li><li>Guided Tour of Versailles Palace</li><li>Visit 2nd level of Eiffel Tower </li><li>Seine River Cruise </li></ul><h4>Belgium</h4><ul><li>Visit Mini Europe</li><li>Orientation Tour of Brussels </li><li>Photo stop at Atomium </li></ul><h4>Netherlands</h4><ul><li>Visit Keukenhof (Till 12th May, 2024)</li><li>Visit Volendam (From 13th May, 2024)</li><li>Visit a Cheese Farm and a Wooden Shoe Workshop </li><li>Enjoy Amsterdam Canal Cruise</li><li>Visit Dam Square </li></ul><h4>Germany</h4><ul><li>Visit the Cologne Cathedral</li><li>Enjoy River Rhine Cruise</li><li>Visit Black Forest  </li></ul><h4>Switzerland</h4><ul><li>View the Rhine Falls </li><li>Visit Mt. Titlis</li><li>Orientation Tour of Lucerne </li></ul><h4>Leichtenstein</h4><ul><li>Enjoy a Mini Train Ride </li></ul><h4>Austria</h4><ul><li>Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and Shop</li><li>Orientation tour of Innsbruck </li></ul><h4>Italy- Venice </h4><ul><li>Visit St. Mark’s Square on a Private Boat</li><li>Orientation tour of Venice</li></ul><h4>Florence</h4><ul><li>Guided Walking Tour </li></ul><h4>Rome</h4><ul><li>Guided City Tour </li></ul><h4>Vatican City</h4><ul><li>Visit the St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</li></ul><h4>Pisa</h4><ul><li>Visit the Field of Miracles - See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</li></ul><h4>Accommodation</h4><ul><li>02 nights in London (LHR Area), United Kingdom, at Hotel Holiday Inn Express LHR / Delta or similar lodging.</li><li>02 nights in Paris (CDG Area), France, at Hotel B&amp;B CDG / Hotel Inn / Ibis Styles CDG or similar places.</li><li>02 nights in Belgium / Netherlands, at NH Koningshof or similar lodging.</li><li>01 night in Germany, at Hotel NH Frankfurt West / NH Mannheim Viernheim or similar lodging.</li><li>03 nights in Engelberg, Switzerland, at Hotel Novotel / Prizeotel or similar lodging.</li><li>01 night in Seefeld / Innsbruck, Austria, at Hotel Alpenkoning or similar lodging.</li><li>01 night in Rovigo, Italy, at Hotel Blue Dream or similar places.</li><li>02 nights in Arezzo / Chianciano Terme, Italy, at Hotel Park or similar lodging. </li></ul><h4>Meals</h4><ul><li>Daily continental buffet breakfast including bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits. </li><li>13 Indian Jain - vegetarian - non-vegetarian lunches.</li><li>14 Indian Jain - vegetarian - non-vegetarian dinners. <br /><em><strong>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain - vegetarian.</strong></em></li></ul><h4>Tour inclusions</h4><ul><li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.  </li><li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li><li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.  </li><li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines mentioned above of the tour.</li><li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. </li><li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).   </li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date. </li><li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li><li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000. </li><li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</li><li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges. </li><li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included. </li><li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li><li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li><li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li><li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded. </li></ul><h4>Visa requirements </h4><ul><li>Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour. </li><li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
