:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:5210:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata. </h2><h3>Destinations Covered </h3><h4>Germany - Berlin</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour </li><li>Entrance to Topography of Terror Museum</li></ul><h4>Dresden</h4><ul><li>Guided City Tour</li></ul><h4>Czech Republic - Prague</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour</li><li>Entrance to the Prague Castle </li><li>Visit St. Vitus Cathedral </li><li>Golden Lane</li><li>Historic Tram Experience</li></ul><h4>Poland - Krakow</h4><ul><li>Horse Carriage ride</li><li>Guided City Tour</li><li>Visit Wieliczka Salt mines</li><li>Auschwitz concentration camp</li></ul><h4>Austria - Vienna</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour</li><li>Visit Schonbrunn Palace</li></ul><h4>Salzburg                         </h4><ul><li>Guided walking tour</li></ul><h4>Hungary - Visegrad</h4><ul><li>Visit Visegrad castle</li><li>See the Knight Tournament</li><li>Visit Palinka factory</li></ul><h4>Budapest</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour</li><li>Hungarian Horsemanship show</li><li>Enjoy the Danube river cruise </li></ul><h4>Croatia</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour of Zagreb</li><li>Visit Plitvice lake national park </li></ul><h4>Slovenia</h4><ul><li>Visit Postojna Caves</li><li>Orientation tour of Ljubljana</li><li>Boat ride in lake Bled </li></ul><h4>Accommodation</h4><ul><li>02 nights in Berlin, Germany, at Courtyard by Marriott Berlin City Centre / Holiday Inn City West or similar lodging.</li><li>02 nights in Prague, Czech Republic, at International Royal Prague / Courtyard by Marriott Prague airport / Clarion Congress or similar lodging.</li><li>02 nights in Krakow, Poland, at Q+ Krakow / Novotel / Swing or similar lodging.</li><li>01 night in Vienna, Austria, at Austria Trend / Event Hotel Pyramide / Holiday Inn or similar places.</li><li>03 nights in Budapest, Hungary, at Park Inn / Novotel / Danubius or similar places. </li><li>02 nights in Zagreb, Croatia, at Grand Hotel / Novotel or similar places. </li><li>01 night in Ljubljana. Slovenia, at Four Points / Radisson Blu / B&amp;B / Holiday Inn Express similar lodging. </li><li>01 Night in Salzburg, Austria, at Austria Trend / Mercure or similar places.  </li></ul><h4>Meals</h4><ul><li>Daily Continental buffet breakfasts that include bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, tea, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits.</li><li>07 Indian Jain / vegetarian/ non-vegetarian lunches.</li><li>14 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian dinners. <br /><strong><em>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.  </em></strong></li></ul><h4>Tour inclusions</h4><ul><li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.  </li><li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li><li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.  </li><li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines mentioned above of the tour.</li><li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. </li><li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).   </li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date. </li><li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li><li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000. </li><li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023)</li><li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges. </li><li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included. </li><li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li><li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li><li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li><li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded. </li></ul><h4>Visa requirements </h4><ul><li>Multiple entry in Schengen &amp; UK visa for the tour. </li><li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
