:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:4566:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata. </h2><h3>Destinations Covered </h3><h4>Paris</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour   </li><li>Visit 2nd level of the Eiffel Tower</li><li>Visit Fragonard – French Perfume Museum</li><li>Enjoy Illumination Tour of Paris</li><li>Seine River Cruise</li><li>Visit Disneyland® Paris·(01 Day 01 Park)</li></ul><h4>Switzerland</h4><ul><li>Visit Mt. Titlis </li><li>Orientation tour of Lucerne </li></ul><h4>Italy- Como</h4><ul><li>Photo Stop at Lake Como</li></ul><h4>Pisa</h4><ul><li>Visit Field of Miracles – See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</li></ul><h4>Rome</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour</li></ul><h4>Vatican City</h4><ul><li>Visit St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</li></ul><h4>Venice</h4><ul><li>Visit St. Mark’s square on a private boat</li><li>Orientation tour of Venice</li></ul><h4>Austria</h4><ul><li>Orientation tour of Innsbruck</li><li>Visit the Swarovski Crystal Museum and Shop</li></ul><h4>Accommodation</h4><ul><li>03 nights in <strong>Paris (CDG Area), France,</strong> at Zenitude CDG / Suite Novotel CDG or similar lodging. </li><li>02 nights in <strong>Switzerland,</strong> at Novotel Zurich Messe / Prizeotel Affoltern am Albis or similar places. </li><li>01 night in <strong>Mendriso / Serpiano, Switzerland,</strong> at Coronado / Serpiano or similar lodging. </li><li>02 nights in <strong>Castiglione / Chianciano Terme, Italy,</strong> at Hotel Park /  Fortuna or similar places. </li><li>01 night in<strong> Vicenza / Verona, Italy,</strong> at Hotel AC by Marriott / Alfa Fiera / SHG Catullo or similar places. </li><li>01 night in <strong>Munich, Germany,</strong> at Hotel Hampton by Hilton / Holiday Inn Express or similar lodging. </li></ul><h4>Meals</h4><ul><li>Daily continental breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, and coffee.</li><li>05 Indian Jain - vegetarian - non-vegetarian lunches.</li><li>10 Indian Jain - vegetarian - non-vegetarian dinners. </li></ul><p><strong><em>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.</em></strong></p><h4>Tour inclusions</h4><ul><li>Return economy class group airfare as per the itinerary.  </li><li>All local taxes and services as of 1st September 2023.</li><li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the duration of the tour.  </li><li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the above-mentioned itinerary.</li><li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.</li><li>Services of a professional, friendly and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to minimum 15 customers). </li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions</h4><ul><li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before the published departure date as mentioned in the brochure or like to come back on a later date after the tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff / travel agent. Kindly note, the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days prior to departure date.  </li><li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing your service e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff etc. It is mandatory to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 11 Days, the total Tips amount is EUR 33 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li><li>Cost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 250,000.</li><li>Any increase in the airfare charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as on 1st September 2023)</li><li>Government Taxes as applicable are extra.</li><li>The tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges.</li><li>No porterage included.</li><li>Any expenses of a personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food and drink not in the regular menu provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li><li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your itinerary.</li><li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in your itinerary.</li><li>Private airport transfers, Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions.  </li></ul><h4>Visa requirements</h4><ul><li>Multiple entry Schengen visa.</li><li>This cost includes documentation, processing and consulate fees. </li></ul><h4>Passport</h4><ul><li>Passport should be valid for 6 months from the date of our departure. </li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
