:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:4890:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2><h3>Destinations Covered</h3><h4>Paris</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour</li><li>Visit 2nd level of the Eiffel Tower</li><li>Visit Fragonard – French Perfume Museum</li><li>Enjoy Illumination Tour on River Seine Cruise</li><li>Visit Disneyland ® Paris</li></ul><h4>Switzerland</h4><ul><li>Visit Mt. Titlis</li><li>Orientation tour of Lucerne</li></ul><h4>Italy - Como</h4><ul><li>Photo Stop at Lake Como</li></ul><h4>Pisa</h4><ul><li>Visit Square of Miracles - See the Leaning Tower of Pisa</li></ul><h4>Rome</h4><ul><li>Guided city tour</li></ul><h4>Venice</h4><ul><li>Visit St. Mark’s square on a private boat</li><li>Orientation Tour of Venice</li></ul><h4>Vatican City</h4><ul><li>Visit St. Peter’s Basilica and Square</li></ul><h4>Austria</h4><ul><li>Orientation tour of Innsbruck</li><li>Visit the Swarovski Crystal museum</li></ul><h4>Accommodation</h4><ul><li>3 nights in <strong>Paris (CDG Area), France,</strong> at Ibis style CDG / Mercure CDG / Zenitude CDG or similar places.</li><li>2 nights in <strong>Switzerland,</strong> at Novotel Zurich Messe / Holiday Inn Express Zurich Messe or similar lodging.</li><li>1 night in <strong>Mendriso / Serpiano, Switzerland,</strong> at Coronado / Serpiano or similar places.</li><li>2 nights in <strong>Arezzo / Castiglion, Italy,</strong> at Hotel Park / President or similar lodging.</li><li>1 night in <strong>Vicenza, Italy,</strong> at Hotel AC / Alpha Fiera or similar lodging.</li><li>1 night in <strong>Munich, Germany</strong> at Hotel Hampton by Hilton / Holiday Inn Express or similar places.</li></ul><h4>Meals</h4><ul><li><strong>Note:</strong> Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.</li><li>05 Indian Jain - vegetarian - non-vegetarian lunches.</li><li>10 Indian Jain - vegetarian - non-vegetarian dinners.</li><li>Daily continental breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, and coffee.</li></ul><h4>Tour inclusions</h4><ul><li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.</li><li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li><li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.</li><li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</li><li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.</li><li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers).</li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions</h4><ul><li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date.</li><li>Tipping is expected from anyone providing you the services e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel &amp; Restaurant staff, etc. This aspect is mandatory, to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is estimated to be EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.</li><li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000.</li><li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023).</li><li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges.</li><li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included.</li><li>No porterage will be included.</li><li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li><li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li><li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li><li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded.</li><li>Safety Regulations for Arrival and Departure PCR – COVID test only if required by the chosen airline or the Government bodies.</li></ul><h4>Visa and Passport requirements</h4><ul><li>Multiple entry in Schengen visa for the tour.</li><li>This cost includes aspects like documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li></ul><p><strong>Passport</strong></p><ul><li>Passport is estimated to be valid for 6 months from the date of our departure.</li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
