:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:4524:\"<p><strong>Departure city: Kolkata. </strong></p><p><strong>Destinations Covered </strong></p><p><strong>London</strong></p><ul><li>Guided City Tour </li><li>Visit Madame Tussauds Wax Museum</li></ul><p><strong>Paris</strong></p><ul><li>Guided City Tour </li><li>Visit 2nd Level Of Eiffel Tower </li><li>Visit The Louvre</li></ul><p><strong>Belgium</strong></p><ul><li>Visit Mini Europe</li><li>Orientation Tour Of Brussels</li></ul><p><strong>Germany</strong></p><ul><li>Visit The Cologne Cathedral</li><li>Enjoy Rhine River Cruise</li><li>Orientation Of Heidelberg  </li></ul><p><strong>Accommodation </strong></p><ul><li>02 nights in <strong>London (LHR Area), United Kingdom</strong> at Hotel Holiday Inn Express or similar lodging. </li><li>02 nights in <strong>Paris (CDG Area), France</strong> at Hotel Moxy CDG / B&amp;B CDG or similar places. </li><li>01 night in <strong>Belgium</strong> at Hotel Ramada Brussels Woulwe / Best Western Brussels South or similar places. </li><li>01 night in <strong>Germany</strong> at Hotel NH Frankfurt West  / Holiday Inn Express or similar lodging. </li><li>03 nights in <strong>Switzerland </strong>at Hotel Ibis Zurich Messe Airport /BB Oftringen / HI Express Neuenkirch or similar places. </li></ul><p><strong>Meals</strong></p><ul><li>Daily Continental Breakfast includes Bread, Butter, Jam, Cereals, Juice, Milk &amp; Coffee. </li><li>08 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Lunches.</li><li>09 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Dinners.</li></ul><p><strong><em>Note: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian.</em></strong> </p><p><strong>Tour inclusions</strong></p><ul><li>Return economy class group airfare as per our tour guidelines.  </li><li>All the local taxes and services are to be paid as of 1st September 2023.</li><li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the entire duration of the tour.  </li><li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the guidelines as mentioned earlier of the tour.</li><li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the tour guidelines) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach. </li><li>Services of a professional, friendly, multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to a minimum of 15 customers). </li><li>Tips are expected for the duration of the tour. </li></ul><p><strong>Tour exclusions </strong></p><ul><li>If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before our published departure date as mentioned in the brochure, or if you like to come back on a later date after the planned tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable for these changes in the plan (subject to availability of seats for the given dates &amp; ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff/travel agent. Kindly note, that the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days before our departure date. </li><li>The cost of the Basic Travel Quota is equivalent to USD 250,000. </li><li>Any increase in the airfare, that is charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as of 1st September 2023). </li><li>Government Taxes are applicable as extra charges. </li><li>The tour cost does not include any charges for POE and passport. No porterage here is included. </li><li>Any expenses of a personal nature like porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food, and drink are not on the regular menu that is provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.</li><li>Meals other than that are mentioned in your tour guidelines.</li><li>Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees, and local guides are availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in the tour guidelines.</li><li>Private airport transfers and the Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions are excluded. </li></ul><p><strong>Visa and passport requirements </strong></p><p><strong>Medical Insurance </strong></p><ul><li>Normal insurance charges for the duration of this tour are included here with their proper ranges of price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and passengers who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges as per their extension plans. </li></ul><p><strong>Visa Requirements </strong></p><ul><li>Multiple entry with Schengen &amp; UK visa.</li><li>This cost includes the documentation, processing, and consulate fees.</li></ul><p><strong>Passport </strong></p><ul><li>Passport is estimated to be valid for 6 months from the date of our departure for the tour</li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
