\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Kashmiri Dinner</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shikara ride on Dal Lake</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gondola ride (Phase - 1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh<br /></span><strong>(Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as additional sightseeing in our itinerary.)</strong></li></ul><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance Included (for age below 69yrs)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and sightseeing by AC Vehicle. (Please note that AC will be switched off during hills )</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All currently applicable hotel taxes except GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4><b>Tour exclusions </b></h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The above Price doesn\'t include:</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any Air or Rail fare.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other meal not mentioned in the price included.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other destination not mentioned in the itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any monument entrance fees, camera fees, and guide charges.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4><b>Itinerary </b></h4><ul><li><h5>Day 1 - Srinagar Houseboats<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></h5><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Noon activity - At leisure.  </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity - At leisure. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner included. </span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><h5>Day 2 - Pahalgam</h5></li></ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning activity - At leisure.  </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Noon activity - At leisure. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity - At leisure. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><h5>Day 3 - Pahalgam<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></h5><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning to Noon Activity - (Start Time: 08:30 | Duration: 07:00 hrs)</span><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"3\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pahalgam Local City Tour </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"3\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aru Valley, Chandanwari, Betab Valley </span></li></ul></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity - At leisure. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><h5>Day 4 - Check-in to Srinagar hotel</h5></li></ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning activity - At leisure.  </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Noon activity - At leisure. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity - At leisure. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><h5>Day 5 - Srinagar</h5></li></ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning to Noon Activity - (Start Time: 09:00 | Duration: 05:00 hrs) </span><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"3\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Excursion Gulmarg. </span></li></ul></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity - At leisure. </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><h5>Day 6 - Srinagar</h5></li></ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-