\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Kashmiri Dinner</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shikara ride on Dal Lake</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gondola ride (Phase - 1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh<br /></span><h4><strong>(Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as additional sightseeing in our itinerary.)</strong></h4></li></ul><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance Included (for age below 69yrs)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and sightseeing by AC Vehicle. (Please note that AC will be switched off during hills )</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All currently applicable hotel taxes except GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4><b>Tour exclusions </b></h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The above Price doesn\'t include:</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any Air or Rail fare.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other meal not mentioned in the price included.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other destination not mentioned in the itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-l