: 400;\">Morning to Noon Activity - (Start Time: 09:00 | Duration: 05:00 hrs) <br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">       Excursion Gulmarg. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity - At leisure. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul><h5>Day 6 - Srinagar</h5><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning to Noon Activity - (Start Time: 09:00 | Duration: 05:00 hrs) <br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">       Excursion Sonmarg. <br />       </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy the beauty of snow-capped peaks and glaciers. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening activity - At leisure. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul><h5>Day 7 - <b>Srinagar </b></h5><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Airport transfers</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included</span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
