 Srinagar</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One photography during Shikara Ride </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experience Of Gondola ride (Phase - 1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy Betab &amp; Aru Valley, Pahalgam</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private Chauffeur Driven Vehicle</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance (for age below 69yrs)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and sightseeing by AC Vehicle. (Please note that AC will be switched off during hills )</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All currently applicable hotel taxes except GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any Air or Rail fare.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other meal not mentioned in the price included.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other destination not mentioned in the itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any monument entrance fees, camera fees, and guide charges.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST @ Current Rate.  </span></li></ul><h4>Itinerary </h4><h4>Day 1 - Check-in to Srinagar hotel </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Srinagar sightseeing. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner included. </span></li></ul><h4>Day 2 - Srinagar to Pahalgam </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul><h4>Day 3 - Pahalgam </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing in Pahalgam.  </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul><h4>Day 4 - Pahalgam to Sonmarg </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Excursion of Sonmarg. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul><h4>Day 5 - Sonmarg to Srinagar </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul><h4>Day 6 - Srinagar to Gulmarg </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Day trip at Gulmarg. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included. </span></li></ul><h4>Day 7 - Departure and transfer to Airport</h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included. </span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20