l Lake, Srinagar</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One photography during Shikara Ride </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experience Of Gondola ride (Phase - 1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to availability)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enjoy Betab &amp; Aru Valley, Pahalgam</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Private Chauffeur Driven Vehicle</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance (for age below 69yrs)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and sightseeing by AC Vehicle. (Please note that AC will be switched off during hills )</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All currently applicable hotel taxes except GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any Air or Rail fare.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other meal not mentioned in the price included.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other destination not mentioned in the itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any monument entrance fees, camera fees, and guide charges.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of a personal nature.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4>Itinerary </h4><h4>Day 1 - Srinagar arrival </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check-in to Srinagar Hotel </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Noon and evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 2 - Check-in to Pahalgam </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hotel check-in </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning, noon and evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfats and dinner included</span></li></ul><h4>Day 3 - Pahalgam sightseeing </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Local city tour (Start Time: 08:30 | Duration: 07:00 hrs)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 4 - Check-in to Gulmarg hotel </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning, noon and evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfats and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 5 - Chek-in to Srinagar hotel </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning, noon and evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfats and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 6 - Sonmarg sightseeing </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Excursion Sonmarg </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 7 - Airport transfers </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flight for return </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included </span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s