e lake </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Kashmiri Dinner</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shikara ride on Dal Lake</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Photography during Shikara Ride with Kashmiri Attire </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gondola ride (Phase - 1) At Gulmarg (Tickets are subject to</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">availability)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Shalimar Bagh</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry Ticket for Nishant Bagh<br /></span><strong>(Note: During the Tulip season, we will visit the Tulip Garden, as an additional sightseeing in our itinerary.)</strong></li></ul><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance Included (for age below 69yrs) </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and sightseeing by AC Vehicle. (Please note that AC will be switched off during hills )</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All currently applicable hotel taxes except GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any Air or Rail fare.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other meal not mentioned in price includes.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other destination not mentioned in itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any monument entrance fees, camera fees, guide charges.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of personal nature.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4>Itinerary </h4><h4>Day 1 - Check-in to Srinagar hotel </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Noon and evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meals included as per tour itinerary </span></li></ul><p><b>Day 2 - Check-in to Pahalgam hotel </b></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning, noon and evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfats and dinner included  </span></li></ul><p><b>Day 3 - Pahalgam sightseeing </b></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Local city tour (Start Time: 08:30 | Duration: 07:00 hrs)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><p><b>Day 4 - Check-in to Gulmarg hotel </b></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning, noon and evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfats and dinner included </span></li></ul><p><b>Day 5 - Sightseeing Gulmarg </b></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Local city tour (Start Time: 09:00 | Duration: 06:00 hrs)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><p><b>Day 6 - Check-in to Srinagar hotel </b></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Srinagar local city tour (Start Time: 09:00 | Duration: 05:00 hrs)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><p><strong>Day 7 - Airport transfers </strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flight for return </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included</span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
