tra Toppings: - Snacks with Coffee / Tea / Cold Drink (Once during the Day)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Srinagar Houseboat Stay</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shikara Ride at Dal Lake</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mughal Gardens – Shalimar Bagh &amp; Nishat Bagh.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tulip Gardens during the bloom time.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Avantipur Ruins &amp; Martand Sun Temple</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orientation Tour of Aru Valley, Betaab Valley &amp; Chandanwari.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kashmiri Cricket Bat Factory</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gondola Ride at Gulmarg (Phase 1)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">500 ml Water Bottles Per Day</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional Tour Manager [Subject to Min. 15 Pax Travelling]</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance (upto the age of 69yrs)</span></li></ul><p><strong>Transfers &amp; sightseeing by AC vehicles  (except for the hilly drives)</strong></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vehicles as per group size on Sharing basis (6 Pax in Innova; 10 in Tempo Traveller; Vehicle Type Cannot be confirmed at the time of Booking)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vehicle is not at disposal – means it is for transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Seats Allotment in the Vehicle is on first come first serve basis at the venue, irrespective of the booking dates.</span></li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Additional / personal use of vehicle.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cost of lunches</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any personal expenses, room service &amp; special orders, mineral water, alcoholic &amp; non alcoholic beverages, porterage, tips, phone calls,</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">laundry etc.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any extra excursions or sightseeing apart from the above specified itinerary.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Camera fees</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any incidental and other expenses which are not specified in the inclusions.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST will be applicable as per prevailing rates </span></li></ul><h4>Itinerary</h4><h4>Day 1 - Arrival in Srinagar </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check-in to Srinagar hotel </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner, snacks and beverages are included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 2 - Srinagar to Pahalgam visit </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 3 - Pahalgam excursion </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Half Day excursion to Aru Valley, Betaab Valley, Chandanwari </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included</span></li></ul><h4>Day 4 - Pahalgam to Sonmarg </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included </span></li></ul><h4>Day 5 - Sonmarg to Srinagar </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included</span></li></ul><h4>Day 6 - Excursion to Gulmarg </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gulmarg excursion  </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast, dinner, snacks and beverages included</span></li></ul><h4>Day 7 - Departure from Srinagar </h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flight transfers </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included </span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
