:7:\"divider\";s:5:\"value\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"type\";s:6:\"normal\";s:9:\"icon-type\";s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"image\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"icon\";s:10:\"fa fa-film\";s:5:\"style\";s:5:\"solid\";s:5:\"align\";s:6:\"center\";s:12:\"divider-type\";s:10:\"horizontal\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-icon\";s:0:\"\";s:21:\"vertical-divider-text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"icon-size\";s:4:\"15px\";s:12:\"divider-size\";s:3:\"1px\";s:13:\"divider-width\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"margin-top\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"45px\";s:13:\"vdi-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"vd-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"vd-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"vd-font-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"vd-text-transform\";s:9:\"uppercase\";s:10:\"icon-color\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"divider-color\";s:0:\"\";}}i:3;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"text-box\";s:5:\"value\";a:25:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:4:\"matt\";s:7:\"content\";s:5155:\"<h2>Departure city: Kolkata.</h2>\n<h3>Destinations Covered</h3>\n<p><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Leh (2 nights) </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nubra Valley (1 night) </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pangong (1 night) </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leh (1 night)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Tour inclusions</h4>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Accommodation in Twin/Double sharing basis in Starting Room category at each place</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">07 breakfasts and 07 dinners</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Transportation by NAC Xylo / Scorpio / Innova (1 to 6 pax) &amp; Non Ac Tempo Trv (7 to 12 pax) (as per availability) for arrival / departure transfers, sightseeing as per the itinerary.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Assistance at the airport while arriving and departing.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Oxygen Cylinder in each vehicle while travelling to Nubra/ Pangong only.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance (for age below 69yrs).<br />\n</span><strong>Misc. charges are inclusive like:</strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ladakh Royalty Fee</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Inner-line permits</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Portages at hotel and airport</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All applicable luxury/ road taxes </span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Tour exclusions</h4>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST will be applicable as per prevailing rates.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Airfares trainfare.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any monastery entrance fees, Any Joy ride or rafting.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Medical expenses (apart from first aid) and insurance of any kind.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips, laundry, liquors, wines, mineral water, telephone charges, camera fee and items of personal nature.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Transportation is not on disposal basis. It is strictly as per the programme, any extra running will be charges extra.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses arising out of unforeseen circumstances like flight delay / cancellation / hike in fare, strike or any other natural calamities or any emergency evacuation expenses.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other item not mentioned in the cost includes section.<br />\n</span><strong>Note: Supplement for English Speaking Local Guide (optional): Rs. 3000.00 per day. </strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Itinerary</h4>\n<h4><b>Day 1 - Arrival at Leh </b></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner included</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><b>Day 2 - Sham Valley Tour </b></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hall Of Fame, Magnetic Hill, Gurudwara Pathar Sahib &amp; Sangam </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included  </span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><b>Day 3 - Leh to Khardung La to Nubra Valley </b></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and excursion of the locality  </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><b>Day 4 - Nubra Valley </b></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Excursion To Turtuk </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><b>Day 5 - Nubra to Pangong </b></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and excursion of the locality  </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><b>Day 6 - Pangong to Leh </b></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and excursion of the locality  </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><b>Day 7 - Departure from Leh </b></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included </span></li>\n</ul>\n\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
