evel=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All transfers and sightseeing by AC Vehicle. (Please note that AC will be switched off during hills )</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All toll taxes, parking charges, driver allowances. </span></li></ul><h4><b>Tour exclusions </b></h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any Air or Rail fare.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any other meal not mentioned in price includes.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tips &amp; PorterageAny monument entrance fees, camera fees, guide charges.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any expenses of personal nature.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GST @ Current Rate </span></li></ul><h4><b>Itinerary </b></h4><h4><b>Day 1 - Ceck-in to Shimla hotel </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner included </span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 2 - Morning to noon sightseeing </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shimla Local with Kufri Jakhu temple </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Naldehra </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kufri </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Kufri Fun Campus </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening Shimla Mall Road Visit </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 3 - Check-in to Manali hotel </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Noon at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 4 - Manali Local City Tour</b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Naggar Hidimba Temple</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Manu Mandir </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vashisth Kund and Naggar Art Gallery  </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening Shimla Mall Road Visit </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 5 - Morning to noon sightseeing </b></h4><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full day Excursion Solang Valley With Gulaba Snow Point </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full day Excursion to Solang Valley With Gulaba Snow Point </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h4><b>Day 6 - Check-in to Chandigarh hotel </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Evening at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included</span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 7 - Airport transfers </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included </span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"