1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Parasada (Guru ka Langar At Golden Temple)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">01 Live Barbeque &amp; Bonfire By The River At Gaj Retreat</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tea tasting Session in Tea Gardens at Palampur</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Travel Insurance - Travel Insurance (for age below 69yrs)</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Transfers &amp; Sightseeing by AC Car. </span></li></ul><h4>Tour exclusions </h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Additional / personal use of vehicle</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any personal expenses, room service &amp; special orders, mineral waters, beverages, porterage , tips, phone calls, laundry etc</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any extra excursions or sightseeing apart from the above specified itinerary</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Camera fees,</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Any incidental and other expenses which are not specified in the inclusions</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Govt service tax (GST) as per prevailing rates. </span></li></ul><h4>Itinerary </h4><h4><b>Day 1 - Arrival in Chandigarh, Palampur </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing during the journey </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dinner included </span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 2 - Palampur visit </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sightseeing and excursion of the locality  </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included</span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 3 - Palampur to Amritsar </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enroute Visit Punjab Village Farm </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Attend Attari border ceremony </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included</span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 4 - Amritsar visit </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Amritsar Local City Tour </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Gobindgarh Fort </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Golden Temple And  Take a Guru ka Langar </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Jallianwala Bagh </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Shri Durgiana temple </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 5 - Amritsar to Hoshiarpur </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit Bhakra-Nangal Dam &amp; Gobind Sagar Lake </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included  </span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 6 - Hoshiarpur </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dairy Farm </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Potter’s Wheel </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tractor &amp; Trolley Ride In The Fields </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bullock Cart Ride </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sundowners </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Live Barbeque &amp; Bonfire By The River </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Star Gazing </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Glamping By The River </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast and dinner included </span></li></ul><h4><b>Day 7 - Departure from Hoshiarpur, Chandigarh </b></h4><ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Morning at leisure </span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Breakfast included</span></li></ul>\";s:10:\"text-align\";s:4:\"left\";s:24:\"apply-the-content-filter\";s:7:\"disable\";s:14:\"enable-p-space\";s:6:\"enable\";s:9:\"font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-line-height\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"content-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"content-text-transform\";s:4:\"none\";s:16:\"tablet-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"mobile-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"text-color\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"enable-text-frame\";s:7:\"disable\";s:13:\"frame-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"frame-background\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"frame-border-radius\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"frame-shadow-size\";s:0:\"\";s:18:\"frame-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"frame-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:16:\"3d-content-z-pos\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"margin-left\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"margin-right\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"41px\";}}}}}'),
