d-shadow-color\";s:0:\"\";s:25:\"background-shadow-opacity\";s:3:\"0.2\";s:7:\"padding\";a:5:{s:3:\"top\";s:4:\"40px\";s:5:\"right\";s:3:\"0px\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:3:\"0px\";s:4:\"left\";s:3:\"0px\";s:8:\"settings\";s:6:\"unlink\";}s:6:\"margin\";a:5:{s:3:\"top\";s:3:\"0px\";s:5:\"right\";s:3:\"0px\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:3:\"0px\";s:4:\"left\";s:3:\"0px\";s:8:\"settings\";s:4:\"link\";}s:14:\"tablet-padding\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"tablet-margin\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"mobile-padding\";a:5:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"settings\";s:4:\"link\";}s:13:\"mobile-margin\";a:5:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"settings\";s:4:\"link\";}s:4:\"skin\";s:0:\"\";}s:5:\"items\";a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:8:\"template\";s:7:\"element\";s:4:\"type\";s:9:\"accordion\";s:5:\"value\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"class\";s:6:\"colasp\";s:4:\"tabs\";a:1:{i:0;a:3:{s:9:\"head-text\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"title\";s:43:\"Travlio - The Best Travel agency in Kolkata\";s:7:\"content\";s:17538:\"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are one of the most eligible </span><b>travel agency </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">in Kolkata that provides tour packages to customers with a proper understanding of their choices and preferences in the tour. With our services of </span><b>tour packages,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> we provide extensive management which makes the tourists more comfortable with us. Details of the tour with proper managerial assistance are provided to our users which makes the experiences more successful making our customers further inclined to our packages. Our tour packages are primarily reliant on the resources of good places that provide comfortable facilities to our travelers while providing them with better conveniences. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As we have different packages of tour destinations, it helps us to focus on our attributes while making the services more customer-centric. We provide various tour packages to our consumers as we tend to identify international packages alongside domestic destinations. We provide </span><b>Europe tour packages </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">that are quite exclusive in our agency as we have various packages for different destinations in Europe. Since we are quite a renowned </span><b>travel agency in Kolkata,</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> it has made our attributes for packaging tour resources more intriguing for the customers. As our packages are developed with proper customer preferences, it helps us to design package costs and other facilities for the tourists. </span></p><h1><b>Top destinations  </b></h1><h2><b>International Tour Packages from Kolkata </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Packages for international destinations are provided by us that are very convenient and reliable for the customers indicating convenient attributes about the consumers. These packages mostly evaluate the European nations, as we provide various packages of places that give different tastes to the tourists. </span></p><h3><b>Paris - Euphoric European Escapades  </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Places like Paris with all its beauty and aesthetics have become more convenient to reach with our support since we give chances of discounted offers, making these tours more affordable. This particular package avails the lighting of the Eiffel Tower while providing extravagant facilities for the Paris tour. </span></p><h3><b>Southeast Asian Serenity  </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This package includes the Southeast Asia region while giving the tourists a chance to explore the warmth and magic of the tropical atmosphere. Cultural immersion in the locality makes this tour package very exotic while providing chances to explore food varieties in the locale. </span></p><h3><b>Middle East Tour Packages - Middle Eastern Magic  </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A trip with vibrant souks, luxurious desert safaris along with an extraordinary view of the pyramids in Egypt is included in this package. It also includes meals and traditional experiences for the tourists while creating an awe-inspiring memorable tour. </span></p><h3><b> Asia tour packages</b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our packages for the Asia tour include exotic urban places like Singapore, Hong Kong, Thailand, Vietnam and many more. Our Singapore tour package offers various picturesque places which includes Lazarus and Pulau Ubin Islands. These exotic places provide natural beauty along with serenity giving a relaxing feeling to the travelers. Exciting visits to theme parks are also available in the Peaceful Sentosa Island that also provide beautiful resorts and lush botanical gardens everywhere. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hong Kong is another place of beauty and a burst of energy which has exciting nightlife making the tours more exotic. The ‘Symphony of Lights’  is one of the most popular  light and sound shows in Hong Kong, making  the tours irresistible. </span></p><h3><b>African Safari Adventures Tour Packages   </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experiencing safari with proper safety measures is included in this package while making the tour memorable and a lifetime experience with the African big five in the jungles. This safari package provides proper comfort and relaxation to travelers along with meal packages that also make the experiences more integrated with the cultural attributes of the African region. </span></p><h3><b>Himalayan Hues in Nepal and Bhutan   </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The view of the Himalayan region is explored in this package while experiencing the serenity of Nepal and Bhutan regions. The serene natural beauty of these areas is the most attractive outlook of this tour package since it also includes meals along with the exploration of the local traditions. </span></p><h3><b>Nepal and Sri Lanka - Enchanting Neighboring Delights   </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The beauty of the tropical areas is included in this package with the exploration of the Nepal and Sri Lankan regions. As the neighboring regions of India are surrounded by both, the tropical weather in Sri Lanka, and the Himalayan cold in Nepal; this package provides chances to explore both. </span></p><h3><b>Crafting Your Personal Dream   </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The creation of personal attributes through tour packages gives exquisite chances to travelers to explore their dream locations with their loved ones. This package is solely dedicated to the personal preferences of the travelers which includes honeymoon destinations along with personalized facilities for the particular requirements of the package. </span></p><h3><b>Australia and New Zealand packages from Kolkata </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tour packages for the regions of Australia along with New Zealand are offered by us which includes the facilities of food and lodging with sightseeing of the locality. Visit to the Opera House in Sydney and the other attractions are included in the package which makes travelers have a wonderful experience throughout the trip. </span></p><h3><b>North America tour packages </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visiting the American region is included in this trip as it allows the exploration of the popular attractions in the USA, such as Las Vegas, New York, Los Angeles San Francisco, and Washington DC to be explored. </span></p><h3><b>South America Summer tour package </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The southern tour explores the Latin region of America, as places like Patagonia, and the forest regions of the Amazon are included in this package. Extensive quality of food and lodging is included in this package while providing a chance for adventure to travelers. </span></p><h3><b>Other notable packages of International Tour are mentioned here:</b></h3><p> </p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Maldives tour packages</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Egypt tour packages</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Russia tour packages </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Turkey tour packages</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Switzerland tour packages</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Dubai tour packages</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Mauritius tour packages</span></li></ul><h2><b>Domestic packages for tours from Kolkata </b></h2><h3><b>Andaman tour packages </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our Andaman packages cover special occasion tours for Durga Puja and also include summer packages which are mostly 5 nights plans. Visiting these exotic places with so much natural greenery makes the tour serene and memorable.</span></p><h3><b>North East tour packages  </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This particular package includes the beauty of mountains with Darjeeling, Gangtok, Pelling, Kalimpong and many other places like these. The serene beauty of mountains makes these trips more intriguing and rejuvenating while making the experiences memorable. </span></p><h3><b>Gujarat tour packages </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Gujarat trip includes destinations like Ahmedabad, Vadodara, Rajkot, temples of Dwarka and Somnath. These places make the tour closer to Indian heritage, making the tour more inspiring. Sabarmati Ashram, the Rani ki Vav stepwell, Gir national park are also included, making chances like seeing the majestic Asiatic lion possible. The Rann Utsav is another part of the festive season of Gujarat making it a culturally uplifting festival for tourists. </span></p><h3><b>Himachal tour packages </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kasol is one of the most popular destinations in Himachal Pradesh that is a part of our tour package. The serene blissful visuals of Kasol makes memories that are unforgettable, while making chances of trekking on the lush green mountains. Remote villages like Spiti Valley have different vibes that will definitely excite you along with the Buddhists monasteries. The visit to Manali will give you a charming experience of snow-capped mountains with a village feel. </span></p><h3><b>Uttarakhand tour packages </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Places of Pilgrimages like Nainital, Haridwar are included in our tour which also makes opportunities of visiting Ganga ‘aarti’ possible. Dehradun is also included in the tour, giving a dreamy feel to the trip. This tour makes our plans to give you the chance of making memories in the mesmerizing hills of Nainital. </span></p><h3><b>Rajasthan tour packages  </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our Jaipur tour will give you the most luxurious feel of traditional heritage while making the memories pleased with aesthetics. City palace is one of the biggest attractions in Jaipur. Grand architectures like Amber Fort and Palace alongside the breathtaking Hawa and Jal Mahal, gives a touch of royalty to the tour package. Wildlife visit is included which gives the chance of having spots of the mighty leopard, hyenas, foxes and deers with exotic birds in the Jhalana Leopard Reserve. The fort of Kumbhalgarh is another attraction with a historical background. </span></p><h3><b>Kerala tour packages </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Beautiful greenery and lush forests are filled in Kerala while you get to feel the soothing natural essence of earth in the Alleppey village. The boating trip will give you the best feel of nature while you enjoy the trip with relaxation and pure joy of wilderness. Kovalam is another palace of beauty that makes this tour more exciting with peaceful boat rides. Motorboat rides with surfing experiences are here to have at affordable ranges. </span></p><h3><b>South India tour packages </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Places like Mysore, Trivandrum are here to enjoy while you get to visit Ooty with its beauty of mystic fog. The amazing view of Padmanabhapuram Palace will mesmerize your visit to South India.</span></p><h3><b>Uttar Pradesh tour packages </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As the old city of Lucknow makes the trip to Uttar Pradesh a little historical while giving it a touch of local cultures and spirituality. The visit to Varanasi will give the tour a place to Remember as it is filled with ethereal looks since there are many mahals that still have the glimpse of the Mughal period.</span></p><h3><b>Bhutan tour packages </b></h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This tour package is very exciting since the view of the Darjeeling flowing rivers and lush green mountains with the touch of snow. The National Museum in Paro is another attraction of Bhutan that calls for excited travelers with a taste of acidic natural beauty and spirituality at once. </span></p><h2><b>Packages for Honeymoon destinations from Kolkata </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Honeymoon tour packages are available with Travlio since we provide plans with international destinations and domestic places as per your preferences. Honeymoon packages offered by us are very affordable while we plan for your adventures in destination tourist spots. </span></p><h1><b>Our value services </b></h1><h2><b>Unparalleled Expertise </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our team will provide you with the in-depth knowledge of traveling while exploring the expenses of these places. as we provide both domestic and international tour packages it makes your journey with Travlio more exciting and unforgettable. </span></p><h2><b>Extensive Destination Coverage </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We provide a wide range of destination places for traveling that are very affordable with our packages while making your experiences more exciting. We make this  tour plans from Kolkata since the popularity of these places included in our tour packages are very desired. </span></p><h2><b>Tailor-Made Itineraries </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We provide customization plans for itineraries which helps to bring extensive joy and comfort to our customers. We tend to Provide better convenience and comfort to our  customers since  we leave that every traveler has their unique tastes. </span></p><h2><b>Customer-Centric Approach </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The choices of our customers are the primary aspect that we follow during making plans for these tours. This approach of ours reflects our dedication and immense respect towards the travelers while giving opportunities of portable destination vacations.</span></p><h2><b>Seamless Booking Process </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">User friendly booking system has made our  plans for Tours more reliable while giving us the chance to fulfill the desires of our travelers. </span></p><h2><b>Affordable Travel Solutions </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Proper plans of Exotic tour packages have made Travlio very reliable in Kolkata, which has made us the perfect partner for Thomas Cook India.</span></p><h2><b>Exclusive Deals and Offers </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We provide exclusive packages for our customers which makes the tours available for personal modifications.</span></p><h2><b>Positive Customer Reviews </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Follow through our customer reviews since feedback is an essential part of our growth which has made our tour packages more convenient over time. </span></p><h1><b>Rewards offered </b></h1><h2><b>Exclusive international packages </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We provide coupons and special tour packages for our customers who are willing to take part in our lucky draw contest. We give chances to visit the northern lights or the Antarctic beauty with our discounted special packages that are given to customers. With your photos in the destination, or your family pictures or Bachelorette vacations in the international tourist spots, you can gain the chance to participate in this lucky draw contest while achieving the chance to visit places once in a lifetime.</span></p><h1><b>Tourist Gallery </b></h1><h2><b>Tour Gallery </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We provide pictures of our land spots of vacation which gives a clear idea of the visit place to the travelers. This also makes the aimed places to be more attractive for the tours. </span></p><h2><b>Destination Gallery </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We have a tour gallery that gives you glimpses of vacations from our customers while having a full fledged idea About our destination packages for both International and Domestic places.</span></p><h1><b>Contact us at your convenience </b></h1><h2><b>Chinar park </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">9/38 Jhautala</span></p><p><b><i>Mail us at:</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> gcpchinarpark@thomascook.in</span></p><p><b><i>Call us on: </i></b></p><h2> </h2><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">03346000164</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">98312 34910 </span></li></ul><h2><b>Salt lake </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AL-2, Sec – 2 </span></p><p><b><i>Mail us at:</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> gcpsaltlake@thomascook.in</span></p><p><b><i>Call us on: </i></b></p><h2> </h2><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">033 40006464</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">98312 34910</span></li></ul><h2><b>Ballygunge </b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">55, Gariahat Road</span></p><p><b><i>Mail us at:</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> gcp.ballygunge@thomascook.in</span></p><p><b><i>Call us on: </i></b></p><h2> </h2><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">033 40014064</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">98312 34910</span></li></ul>\";}}s:6:\"active\";s:1:\"0\";s:22:\"allow-closing-all-tabs\";s:6:\"enable\";s:5:\"style\";s:4:\"icon\";s:12:\"with-divider\";s:7:\"disable\";s:5:\"align\";s:4:\"left\";s:13:\"icon-position\";s:4:\"left\";s:15:\"title-font-size\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"title-font-style\";s:6:\"normal\";s:17:\"title-font-weight\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"title-letter-spacing\";s:0:\"\";s:20:\"title-text-transform\";s:7:\"default\";s:13:\"title-padding\";a:5:{s:3:\"top\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"right\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"bottom\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"left\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"settings\";s:6:\"unlink\";}s:14:\"padding-bottom\";s:4:\"30px\";}}}}}'),
