(5612,1,'2024-02-26 07:19:46','2024-02-26 07:19:46','<h5>You can test the tour management system in this theme easily</h5>\n[gdlr_core_space height=\"40px\"]\n\n<strong>1.  Simply create an account with the link on the top right corner of this page.</strong>\nTry to use your real email. The email notification will be sent to your email after booking.\n\n<strong>2. Perform booking the tour from the demo site. </strong>You can also test the payment by using Paypal Sandbox.\n\nMake sure that you have created your own Paypal Sandbox account to test the payment.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.sandbox.paypal.com/us/webapps/mpp/account-selection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.sandbox.paypal.com/us/webapps/mpp/account-selection</a> (With Paypal Sandbox, you can test the payment by using virtual money.)\n\n<a href=\"https://demo.goodlayers.com/traveltour/main3/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/Screen-Shot-2017-01-31-at-16.35.33.png\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4971\" src=\"https://demo.goodlayers.com/traveltour/main3/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/Screen-Shot-2017-01-31-at-16.35.33.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" /></a>\n\n<strong>3. After you booked the tour or paid by Paypal, you can view the transaction from customer dashboard</strong> : <a href=\"http://demo.goodlayers.com/traveltour/dashboard/?page_type=dashboard\">http://demo.goodlayers.com/traveltour/dashboard/?page_type=dashboard </a>','Test the system','','inherit','closed','closed','','4967-revision-v1','','','2024-02-26 07:19:46','2024-02-26 07:19:46','',4967,'https://travlio.in/?p=5612',0,'revision','',0),
