(7620,1,'2023-01-30 11:22:02','2023-01-30 11:22:02','The Nepal tour package has been very pleasant of surprises and investigation of massive regions of the green valleys and the Himalayan Mountains. Nepal has been one the most attractive tourist destinations to visit. Traveling teaches you how to make the newest friends and you might make friends when you travel to the newest locations.\n<h2><strong><b>Attractive tourist destinations in Nepal</b></strong></h2>\nNo matter where you are, Nepal\'s natural wonders always surround you.\n<ul>\n 	<li>The attractive tourist destinations in Nepal are Bhaktapur Durbar Square, Kathmandu, Lumbini, Pokhara, Swayambhunath Temple, white water rafting, Pashupatinath Temple, Boudhanath Stupa, Annapurna Trek, etc.</li>\n 	<li>Different places, temples, courtyards, etc., constitute Bhaktapur Durbar Square, and artisans built all these structures in the cultural Nepalese architecture.</li>\n 	<li>The Teleju Temple has been the most significant portion of Bhaktapur Durbar Square and is one of the most admirable holy places for human beings living in Nepal.</li>\n 	<li>Situated on the top of a hill west of Kathmandu city, the Swayambhunath Complex is in use since the fifty century and comprises an awesome doomed stupa along with different temples and holy places.</li>\n 	<li>Lumbini has been famous and well-known in Nepal since it is the birthplace of Lord Buddha and thousands of worshippers visit this place each year to meditate, worship, and study in the site.</li>\n 	<li>The Hindus have devoted Pashupatinath Temple to Lord Shiva, and it is situated in Kathmandu, Nepal.</li>\n</ul>\n<a href=\"https://travlio.in/\"><strong><b>Nepal tour cost from Kolkata</b></strong></a> has been the best international tour package provided by Travlio to tourists at affordable cost.\n<h2><strong>Inventing the natural scenic beauties of Nepal</strong></h2>\nSome of the reputed natural scenic beauties of Nepal are:-\n<ul>\n 	<li>Rara Lake</li>\n 	<li>Moun