(7632,1,'2023-02-06 10:04:21','2023-02-06 10:04:21','In case you want to escape from the everyday noisy life and have been looking for calmness, the mountains of  Uttarakhand could assist you in accomplishing some peace. ‘Travlio’ offers the best tour package to people at fewer prices. It provides the <strong><b>best Uttarakhand tour packages from<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\"> Kolkata</a>.         </b></strong>\n<h2><strong><b> </b></strong><strong><b>The top tourist locations in Uttarakhand</b></strong></h2>\n<strong><b> </b></strong>Uttarakhand has been housed in extensive steep mountains as well as hills, cuisine, rich culture, soft green forests, and divinity which could add towards your development, progress, and development as a human being. Some of the best tourist destinations in Uttarakhand are Dehradun and Mussoorie, Haridwar and Rishikesh, Ranikhet and Nainital, Chardham, Jim Corbett National Park, etc.\n<h3><strong><b>Dehradun and Mussoorie</b></strong></h3>\nPeople have known Dehradun for its pleasurable year-round weather as well as scenic beauty surroundings. It is the capital of Uttarakhand. During the winter season, heavy snowfall occurs in Dehradun, and higher mountains and Lul Sal forests surround it. The picturesque beauty, vibrant community, and entertainment make Mussoorie, the queen of hill stations, renowned. The wonderful climate makes it a pretty holiday resort.\n<h3><strong><b>Haridwar and Hrishikesh</b></strong></h3>\nHaridwar, famed for its Ganga ghats and temples, draws devotees seeking purification and salvation through ritual bathing. Har Ki Pauri, a renowned Ganga ghat, is a central attraction for pilgrims in Haridwar. Rishikesh has renowned itself as a center for learning meditation and yoga. It has been a celebrated spiritual town.\n<h3><strong><b>Ranikhet and Nainital</b></strong></h3>\nNainital, famed for tourism, also houses prestigious British-era educational institutions. The broader variety of activities filled Ranikhet, making it a splendid adventure tourist location.\n<h3><strong><b>Chardham</b></strong></h3>\nSuch a journey has been a tour of four holy sites and these are Badrinath, Kedarnath, Gangotri, and Yamunotri. Kedarnath Temple, devoted to Lord Shiva, is one of the sacred pilgrimage centers in north India. Furthermore, people have dedicated Badrinath Temple to Lord Vishnu. The pilgrims undertake difficult journeys via the Himalayas for reaching this holy and religious place. The river Bhagirathi situates Gangotri, a beautiful religious town, on its banks. Additionally, people have dedicated Yamunotri Temple to Goddess Yamuna and it possesses a black marble idol of the goddess. Yamunotri Temple is located at the western region of Garhwal Himalayas at Uttarkashi district in Uttarakhand.\n<h3><strong><b>Jim Corbett National Park</b></strong></h3>\nIndian national parks have renowned this park for having the highest number of tigers.\n\n<a href=\"https://travlio.in/travlio-domestic-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\">Travlio is an excellent domestic</a> and global tour guide. Moreover, travlio, the <strong><b>best Uttarakhand tour package from Kolkata </b></strong>serves the demands and requirements of the customers.','Best Uttarakhand tour packages from kolkata','','publish','open','open','','best-uttarakhand-tour-packages-kolkata','','','2023-02-06 10:04:21','2023-02-06 10:04:21','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7632',0,'post','',0),
