(7646,1,'2023-02-16 07:58:31','2023-02-16 07:58:31','Discover the Best of India with Travlio’s Holiday Packages from Kolkata\n\nKolkata, the city of joy, is a hub of travelers and tourism. Many people from Kolkata love to travel to different parts of the country and explore its diverse beauty. And, what better way to do that than with a well-planned holiday package from a reliable travel agency. Travlio is one such travel agency that has been providing the <a href=\"https://travlio.in/\">best holiday packages from Kolkata</a> for quite some time now. In this blog, we will discuss the best holiday packages from Kolkata offered by Travlio.\n<h1>Best Holiday Packages from Kolkata -</h1>\n<h2>North India Tour Package from Kolkata</h2>\nNorth India is a region that is rich in culture, history, and natural beauty. Travlio\'s North India Tour Package from Kolkata covers some of the most popular destinations in North India, including Delhi, Agra, and Jaipur. This package is perfect for those who are interested in exploring the historical monuments, rich culture, and local cuisines of North India.\n<h2>South India Tour Package from Kolkata</h2>\nSouth India is a region that is known for its pristine beaches, lush green forests, and stunning temples. Travlio\'s South India Tour Package from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a> covers some of the most popular destinations in South India, including Chennai, Mumbai, and Goa. This package is perfect for those who are looking for a relaxing and rejuvenating holiday by the beach.\n<h2>East India Tour Package from Kolkata</h2>\nEast India is a region that is known for its tea gardens, rolling hills, and diverse wildlife. Travlio\'s East India Tour Package from Kolkata covers some of the most popular destinations in East India, including Darjeeling, Kalimpong, and Gangtok. This package is perfect for those who are looking to experience the natural beauty and serenity of the hills.\n<h2>West India Tour Package