(7649,1,'2023-02-21 05:36:57','2023-02-21 05:36:57','Discover the Beauty of Uttarakhand: Best Tour Packages from Kolkata\n\nTravlio, a premier travel agency based in Kolkata, offers an exciting North East tour package that is perfect for those who want to explore the scenic beauty of this region. The package is designed to provide travelers with an immersive experience of the diverse culture and rich heritage of North East India. This tour package is ideal for families, groups of friends, and solo travelers looking to explore the beautiful and serene destinations in the North East.\n\nThe <a href=\"https://travlio.in/travlio-domestic-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\"><u>North East tour package from Kolkata</u></a> covers popular destinations like Gangtok, Darjeeling, and Kalimpong. The package is carefully curated to offer travelers the best of what the North East has to offer. The tour begins with a visit to Gangtok, Sikkim\'s capital city, renowned for breathtaking landscapes, picturesque monasteries, and warm hospitality. The package includes a visit to the renowned Tsomgo Lake, also known as Changu Lake, situated at an altitude of 12,310 feet. The serene lake is surrounded by snow-capped mountains, making it an ideal spot for nature lovers and photographers.\n\nThe tour then heads to Darjeeling, the queen of the hills, renowned for tea plantations, scenic beauty, and colonial architecture. The package includes a visit to Tiger Hill, where travelers can witness the spectacular sunrise over the Himalayan range. The tour also visits the Batasia Loop, a railway loop providing panoramic views of the surrounding mountains.\n\nThe North East tour package from Kolkata also covers Kalimpong, a beautiful town located on the foothills of the Himalayas. Known for its exotic flowers, beautiful orchids, and stunning views of the Himalayan range, the town attracts attention. The package includes a visit to the Durpin Hill, which offers breathtaking views of the surrounding landscape.\n\nThe tour package covers other popular North East attractions, including the Rumtek Monastery, Ghoom Monastery, and the Himalayan Mountaineering Institute.\n\nTravlio designed the North East tour package from Kolkata to offer travelers a hassle-free and comfortable experience. The package includes accommodation in comfortable hotels, transportation in air-conditioned vehicles, and meals as per the itinerary. The tour is led by experienced and knowledgeable tour guides who ensure that travelers have a memorable and enriching experience.\n\n<a href=\"https://travlio.in/\"><u>Travlio</u></a> also offers customization options for travelers who want to design their own itinerary. The travel agency\'s experienced team of consultants can help travelers plan their ideal North East tour package from Kolkata.\n\nOverall, Travlio\'s North East tour package from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a> is an excellent choice for travelers looking to explore the serene and picturesque destinations in the North East. The package provides an ideal blend of culture, nature, and adventure, perfect for families, friends, and solo travelers.','Discover the Beauty of Uttarakhand: Best Tour Packages from Kolkata','','publish','open','open','','discover-the-beauty-of-uttarakhand-best-tour-packages-from-kolkata','','','2023-02-21 05:36:57','2023-02-21 05:36:57','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7649',0,'post','',0),
