ravel Planning','','publish','open','open','','best-travel-agencies-in-kolkata-your-guide-to-hassle-free-travel-planning','','','2023-02-24 06:10:59','2023-02-24 06:10:59','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7653',0,'post','',0),
(7658,1,'2023-03-03 09:40:42','2023-03-03 09:40:42','[caption id=\"attachment_7659\" align=\"alignnone\" width=\"1024\"]<img class=\"wp-image-7659 size-full\" src=\"https://travlio.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Tour-packages-from-Kolkata-to-Uttarakhand.jpeg\" alt=\"Tour packages from Kolkata to Uttarakhand\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" /> Tour packages from Kolkata to Uttarakhand[/caption]\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Are you looking to escape the hustle and bustle of city life and embark on a journey to the serene and picturesque landscapes of <a href=\"https://travlio.in/uttarakhand-tour-packages-kolkata-2023\">Uttarakhand</a>? Look no further than these amazing tour packages from Kolkata to Uttarakhand.</span>\n<h2><b>Explore the Char Dham Yatra:</b></h2>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Embark on a spiritual journey with our Char Dham Yatra package which includes visits to the four holy shrines of Yamunotri, Gangotri, Kedarnath, and Badrinath. The package includes transportation, accommodation, and meals, along with a knowledgeable guide to provide insights into the history and significance of each shrine.</span>\n<h3><b>Discover the Beauty of Mussoorie and Dhanaulti:</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\'re looking for a peaceful getaway amidst lush greenery and misty mountains, our Mussoorie and Dhanaulti package is perfect for you. Enjoy a scenic drive from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a> to Mussoorie and spend your days exploring the charming hill station, visiting local markets, and indulging in adventure activities like trekking, camping, and paragliding.</span>\n<h3><b>Unwind in the Tranquil Environment of Nainital:</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Escape the city\'s heat and pollution with our Nainital package for a relaxing vacation in nature\'s embrace. Relax in a lakeside resort, take a leisurely boat ride, or explore the nearby areas on foot. You can also opt for adventure activities like trekking and rappelling.</span>\n<h3><b>Experience the Thrill of Rishikesh:</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For adventure enthusiasts, our Rishikesh package offers an adrenaline-pumping experience with river rafting, bungee jumping, and camping under the stars. The package also includes a visit to the famous Beatles Ashram and a spiritual tour of the city\'s ancient temples.</span>\n<h3><b>Witness the Majestic Himalayas in Auli:</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\'re a nature lover, our Auli package is perfect for you. Known for its stunning views of the Himalayas, Auli is a popular skiing destination in Uttarakhand. Spend your days skiing or snowboarding, take a cable car ride, or simply relax in the beautiful surroundings.</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In conclusion, these tour packages offer something for every traveler - from spiritual seekers to adventure enthusiasts to nature lovers. Book your package today and get ready to explore the enchanting beauty of Uttarakhand.</span>','Tour packages from Kolkata to Uttarakhand','','publish','open','open','','tour-packages-from-kolkata-to-uttarakhand','','','2023-03-03 09:40:42','2023-03-03 09:40:42','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7658',0,'post','',0),
(7674,1,'2023-03-10 10:11:51','2023-03-10 10:11:51','How Many Countries Are There In The World As A Travel Haven In 2023?\n\nAs of 2023, there are 195 recognized sovereign states in the world. These are countries that have a defined territory, a government, and are recognized by other countries as independent and sovereign states. However, this number is constantly changing due to political instability, secessionist movements, and other geopolitical factors. So if you want to know about How Many Countries Are There In The World As A Travel Haven In 2023 go through the following articles\n\nApart from the recognized sovereign states, there are also other territories and regions that are not independent but have some level of autonomy or special status. These include territories like Puerto Rico, Greenland, and Hong Kong, among others.\n<h2><strong>International tour packages from Kolkata : </strong></h2>\nKolkata, the cultural capital of India, is a city that is steeped in history and tradition. It is a city that has something for everyone, whether you are a foodie, a history buff, or an art lover. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a> is also an excellent base for those looking to explore the world. Here are some popular international tour packages from Kolkata offered by Travlio:\n<h3><strong>Thailand Tour Package :\n</strong></h3>\nThailand is a popular destination among Indian travellers. The country is known for its beautiful beaches, exotic food, and vibrant nightlife. The Thailand Tour Package from Kolkata offered by Travlio includes visits to Bangkok, Pattaya, and Phuket, among other destinations. The package includes flights, accommodation, transfers, and sightseeing tours.\n<h3><strong>Singapore-Malaysia Tour Package</strong> :</h3>\nThe Singapore-Malaysia Tour Package is another popular option for those looking to explore Southeast Asia. This package includes visits to Singapore and Malaysia, covering destinations like Kuala Lumpur,