(7681,1,'2023-03-15 11:52:25','2023-03-15 11:52:25','Shimla, Kullu, and Manali, located in the northern part of India, are some of the most popular tourist destinations in the country. The picturesque mountains, serene rivers, and lush green valleys make it an ideal destination for vacationers from all over the world. If you are planning to visit these destinations, there are several <a href=\"https://travlio.in/travlio-domestic-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\">domestic tour packages from Kolkata </a>that you can choose from. In this blog, we will discuss some of the most popular Shimla-Kullu-Manali tour packages for a fabulous vacation in 2023, offered by the travel brand \"Travlio\".\n<h2><strong>Our Tour Packages from Kolkata in 2023 </strong>:</h2>\n<h3><strong>Shimla-Kullu-Manali Tour Package - 5 Nights and 6 Days :</strong></h3>\nTravlio offers a 5 nights and 6 days tour package that covers Shimla, Kullu, and Manali. The package includes accommodation in comfortable hotels, meals, and sightseeing tours. You will get to explore the famous attractions in Shimla, Kullu, and Manali such as the Hadimba Temple, Solang Valley, and Rohtang Pass. This tour package also includes a visit to the Vashist Hot Springs, where you can enjoy a relaxing bath in the natural hot springs.\n<h3><strong>Shimla-Manali Tour Package - 4 Nights and 5 Days :</strong></h3>\nThis tour package is perfect for travellers who want to explore the beautiful cities of Shimla and Manali. The package includes accommodation in comfortable hotels, meals, and sightseeing tours. You will get to visit the famous attractions in Shimla such as the Mall Road, Christ Church, and the Ridge. In Manali, you can explore the Hadimba Temple, Solang Valley, and Rohtang Pass.\n<h3><strong>Kullu-Manali Tour Package - 3 Nights and 4 Days :</strong></h3>\nIf you want to explore the scenic beauty of Kullu and Manali, this tour package is perfect for you. The package includes accommodation in comfortable hotels, meals, and sightseeing tours. You will get to visit the famous attractions in Kullu such as the Bhuntar Airport, Kullu Shawl Factory, and the Kullu Valley. In Manali, you can explore the Hadimba Temple, Solang Valley, and Rohtang Pass.\n<h3><strong>Shimla-Kullu-Manali Honeymoon Tour Package - 6 Nights and 7 Days :</strong></h3>\nIf you are planning a romantic honeymoon, this tour package is perfect for you. The package includes accommodation in comfortable hotels, meals, and sightseeing tours. You will get to visit the famous attractions in Shimla, Kullu, and Manali such as the Mall Road, Christ Church, Hadimba Temple, Solang Valley, and Rohtang Pass. This tour package also includes a candlelight dinner and a flower bed decoration in the hotel room to make your honeymoon more memorable.\n<h3><strong>Shimla-Kullu-Manali Adventure Tour Package - 7 Nights and 8 Days :</strong></h3>\nFor adventure enthusiasts, this tour package is perfect as it includes several adventure activities such as trekking, river rafting, and paragliding. The package includes accommodation in comfortable hotels, meals, and sightseeing tours. You will get to visit the famous attractions in Shimla, Kullu, and Manali and also indulge in thrilling adventure activities.\n<h3><strong>Shimla-Kullu-Manali Family Tour Package - 8 Nights and 9 Days :</strong></h3>\nThis tour package is perfect for families who want to explore the beautiful cities of Shimla, Kullu, and Manali. The package includes accommodation in comfortable hotels, meals, and sightseeing tours. Explore the renowned attractions in Shimla, Kullu, and Manali while indulging in adventure activities like river rafting.\n\n<a href=\"https://travlio.in/\">Travlio</a> is a leading travel agency in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a> that offers international tour packages to various destinations worldwide.','Popular Shimla-Kullu-Manali Tour Packages in 2023.','','publish','open','open','','popular-shimla-kullu-manali-tour-package