(7695,1,'2023-03-23 12:37:52','2023-03-23 12:37:52','<h2>Gujarat in 2023 , best places to visit :</h2>\nGujarat, the land of colours, culture, and rich heritage, is a perfect destination for travellers seeking a unique experience. With its vibrant traditions, ancient temples, and bustling markets, Gujarat offers a plethora of experiences for visitors. If you are planning a trip to Gujarat in 2023, here are some of the best places to visit, and <a href=\"https://travlio.in/travlio-domestic-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\">domestic tour packages from Kolkata</a> that will take you there.\n<h3>Ahmedabad :</h3>\nAhmedabad, the former capital of Gujarat, is a vibrant city that offers a perfect blend of modernity and tradition. The city is renowned for its rich history, architecture, and mouth-watering food. Some of the must-visit places in Ahmedabad are the Sabarmati Ashram, which was home to Mahatma Gandhi, the Jama Masjid, the Bhadra Fort, and the Kankaria Lake. Domestic tour packages from Kolkata to Ahmedabad are readily available and offer a hassle-free experience for travellers.\n<h3>Dwarka :</h3>\nDwarka, situated on the western coast of Gujarat, is a city steeped in mythology and history. Believers consider it the place where Lord Krishna built his kingdom, and it hosts one of the four Char Dham pilgrimage sites in India. The main attraction in the city is the Dwarkadhish Temple, dedicated to Lord Krishna. Domestic tour packages from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a> to Dwarka offer visitors an opportunity to explore the city\'s rich history and culture.\n<h3>Somnath :</h3>\nSomnath, situated on the western coast of Gujarat, is another important pilgrimage site in the state. The Somnath Temple, which is dedicated to Lord Shiva, is one of the twelve Jyotirlingas in India. Believers attribute the original construction of the temple in gold to Lord Soma, the Moon God, and it has undergone destruction and rebuilding several times over the centuries. Domestic tour packages from Kolkata to Somnath offer visitors a chance to experience the city\'s spirituality and ancient history.\n<h3>Gir National Park :</h3>\nGir National Park in Gujarat is the only place globally to spot Asiatic lions in their natural habitat. A must-visit for wildlife enthusiasts, the park is home to a diverse range of flora and fauna. Explore Kolkata\'s Gir National Park tour packages to discover its vast expanse and spot rare animal and bird species.\n<h3>Rann of Kutch :</h3>\nThe Rann of Kutch, situated in the Thar Desert, is a unique destination that offers a one-of-a-kind experience for visitors. The Rann is a vast expanse of white salt that stretches for miles and creates a mesmerising landscape. Visit the Rann of Kutch during the three-month-long Rann Utsav to experience and celebrate the region\'s culture, art, and music. Explore Kolkata\'s Rann of Kutch tour packages for a chance to witness the festival and experience the region\'s unique beauty.\n<h3>Conclusion :</h3>\nGujarat is a state that offers visitors a unique and diverse range of experiences. From its ancient temples to its bustling markets and wildlife parks, Gujarat has something for everyone. If you are planning a trip to Gujarat in 2023, the <a href=\"https://travlio.in/\">domestic tour packages from Kolkata</a> mentioned above will offer you a hassle-free experience and allow you to explore the state\'s hidden treasures. So, pack your bags and get ready to explore the colourful and vibrant state of Gujarat.','The best places to visit in Gujarat in 2023.','','publish','open','open','','the-best-places-to-visit-in-gujarat-in-2023','','','2023-03-23 12:37:52','2023-03-23 12:37:52','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7695',0,'post','',0),
(7706,1,'2023-03-31 12:08:20','2023-03-31 12:08:20','<h2>Trip to Leh Ladakh in 2023 :</h2>\nPlanning a trip to Leh<a href=\"https://travlio.in/ladakh-tour\"> Ladakh</a> in 2023, you are in for a treat. With its breathtaking landscapes, stunning views, and unique culture, Leh Ladakh is one of the most popular destinations in India for adventure enthusiasts, nature lovers, and culture seekers alike. But before you start packing your bags, there are some things you need to know to make the most of your trip. In this blog post, we will provide you with some useful tips on how to plan a trip to Leh Ladakh in 2023, including information on domestic tour packages from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a>.\n<h3>Decide on your travel dates :</h3>\nThe first step in planning your trip to Leh Ladakh is deciding on your travel dates. The best time to visit Leh Ladakh is from May to September when the weather is pleasant and the roads are open. However, if you are looking for a more adventurous trip, you can also plan your visit in the winter months when the snow-covered landscapes create a magical atmosphere.\n<h3>Book your flights :</h3>\nOnce you have decided on your travel dates, the next step is to book your flights. If you are travelling from Kolkata, there are several airlines that operate direct flights to Leh, including Air India, GoAir, and Vistara. You can also book your flight through domestic tour packages from Kolkata offered by travel companies like Travlio, which can help you save money and time.\n<h3>Plan your itinerary :</h3>\nWhen planning your itinerary for Leh Ladakh, keep in mind that the region is vast and there is a lot to see and do. Some of the must-visit places in Leh Ladakh include Pangong Tso Lake, Nubra Valley, Magnetic Hill, and Shanti Stupa. You can also explore the local culture by visiting monasteries like Hemis Monastery, Thiksey Monastery, and Diskit Monastery. Domestic tour packages from Kolkata can help you plan your itinerary based on your preferences and budget.\n<h3>Choose your accommodation :</h3>\nThere are several options for accommodation in Leh Ladakh, including hotels, guesthouses, and homestays. If you are looking for a more authentic experience, you can opt for a homestay where you can stay with a local family and learn about their way of life. However, if you prefer more comfortable accommodations, there are several hotels and guesthouses that offer modern amenities and services.\n<h3>Get your permits :</h3>\nTo visit certain areas in Leh Ladakh, you need to obtain permits from the local authorities. These include permits for Pangong Tso Lake, Nubra Valley, and Tso Moriri Lake. You can apply for these permits through the local tourist office or through domestic tour packages from Kolkata offered by travel companies like Travlio.\n<h3>Pack wisely :</h3>\nWhen packing for your trip to Leh Ladakh, keep in mind that the weather can be unpredictable, so it is important to pack warm clothing, a good pair of hiking shoes, and sunscreen. You should also bring a first aid kit, insect repellent, and a water bottle to stay hydrated.\n\nIn conclusion, planning a trip to Leh Ladakh in 2023 can be an exciting and memorable experience. By following these tips and using domestic tour packages from Kolkata, you can make the most of your trip and create unforgettable memories. Whether you are a nature lover, adventure enthusiast, or culture seeker, Leh Ladakh has something to offer everyone.','How to Plan a Trip to Leh Ladakh in 2023?','','publish','open','open','','how-to-plan-a-trip-to-leh-ladakh-in-2023','','','2023-03-31 12:08:20','2023-03-31 12:08:20','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7706',0,'post','',0),
(7719,1,'2023-04-12 12:30:50','2023-04-12 12:30:50','<h2><strong>Travlio: America Tour Packages From Kolkata :\n</strong></h2>\nTravelling is one of the best ways to explore new places, learn about different cultures and have fun. America, also known as the land of opportunities, has always been a popular travel destination for people from all over the world. Kolkata, the city of joy, is no exception. In this blog, we will discuss the top 5 <strong>America tour packages from Kolkata </strong>that will amaze you in 2023.\n<h3><strong>West Coast Wonders : </strong></h3>\nThe West Coast of America is famous for its scenic beauty, sunny beaches and lively cities. <a href=\"https://travlio.in/\"><strong>America tour package from Kolkata</strong></a> will take you on a journey through the West Coast of America, where you will explore cities like San Francisco, Los Angeles, and Las Vegas. You will get to see some of the most famous attractions of the West Coast, such as the Golden Gate Bridge, Hollywood Walk of Fame and the Las Vegas Strip. You will also get to experience the natural beauty of the region, such as the Grand Canyon, Yosemite National Park and Lake Tahoe.\n<h3><strong>East Coast Extravaganza :</strong></h3>\nThe East Coast of America is known for its rich history, diverse culture and stunning architecture. <a href=\"https://travlio.in/\"><strong>America tour package from Kolkata</strong></a> will take you on a journey through the East Coast of America, where you will explore cities like New York, Washington DC, and Boston. You will get to see some of the most famous landmarks of the East Coast, such as the Statue of Liberty, White House and the Freedom Trail. You will also get to experience the vibrant culture of the region, such as the Broadway shows, jazz music and local cuisine.\n<h3><strong>Alaska Adventure :</strong></h3>\nAlaska, also known as the last frontier, is a land of glaciers, wildlife and natural beauty. This tour package from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a> will take you on a journey through the rugged terrain of Alaska, where you will explore cities like Anchorage, Denali and Fairbanks. You will get to see some of the most famous attractions of Alaska, such as the Denali National Park, Kenai Fjords National Park and the Northern Lights. You will also get to experience the unique culture of the region, such as the indigenous people and their traditions.\n<h3><strong>Southern Charm :</strong></h3>\nThe Southern region of America is known for its hospitality, history and food. <strong>America tour package from Kolkata </strong>will take you on a journey through the Southern region of America, where you will explore cities like New Orleans, Nashville and Savannah. You will get to see some of the most famous landmarks of the region, such as Bourbon Street, Grand Ole Opry and the Historic District of Savannah. You will also get to experience the unique culture of the region, such as the jazz music, country music and local cuisine.\n<h3><strong>Hawaii Honeymoon :</strong></h3>\nHawaii, also known as the paradise of the Pacific, is a popular honeymoon destination for couples from all over the world. This specially designed honeymoon tour package from Kolkata allows couples to explore the islands of Hawaii, such as Maui, Oahu, and Kauai. You will get to see some of the most romantic spots of Hawaii, such as the Waikiki Beach, Haleakala National Park and the Napali Coast. You will also get to experience the local culture of the region, such as the hula dance, lei-making and Hawaiian cuisine.\n\nTravelling to America is a dream come true for many people. <a href=\"https://travlio.in/international-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\"><strong>America tour packages from Kolkata</strong></a> will not only fulfil your dream but also provide you with a once-in-a-lifetime experience. From the natural beauty of Alaska to the lively cities of the West Coast, America has something to offer for everyone. So, pack your bags and get ready for an amazing journey to America.','Top 5 America tour packages from Kolkata amazed you in 2023?','','publish','open','open','','top-5-america-tour-packages-from-kolkata-amazed-you-in-2023','','','2023-04-12 12:30:50','2023-04-12 12:30:50','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7719',0,'post','',0),
(7722,1,'2023-04-12 12:37:47','2023-04-12 12:37:47','<h2><strong>Travlio : </strong><strong>Nepal tour cost from Kolkata</strong><strong> :\n</strong></h2>\nAre you planning to travel to Nepal from Kolkata in 2023? If yes, then you are in for a surprise. Nepal, the land of the Himalayas, is one of the most beautiful countries in the world. It is a popular destination among Indian travellers because of its close proximity to India and the availability of affordable travel options. In this blog, we will discuss the <a href=\"https://travlio.in/international-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\"><strong>Nepal tour cost from Kolkata</strong></a> in 2023 and provide you with all the information you need to plan your trip.\n<h2><strong>Why Should You Visit Nepal in 2023?\n</strong></h2>\nNepal is a land of contrasts. It is home to the highest mountain in the world, Mount Everest, and also the birthplace of Lord Buddha. The country is rich in culture, history, and natural beauty. Some of the reasons why you should visit Nepal in 2023 are:\n<h3><strong>Trekking and Hiking:</strong></h3>\nNepal is a trekker\'s paradise. The country is home to some of the best trekking trails in the world, including the Annapurna Circuit, Everest Base Camp, and Langtang Valley. The best time to trek in Nepal is from September to November and March to May.\n<h3><strong>Cultural Tours:</strong></h3>\nNepal is a melting pot of cultures. The country is home to diverse ethnic groups, each with its own unique culture and traditions. You can explore the ancient temples and monasteries, participate in local festivals and rituals, and learn about the Nepalese way of life.\n<h3><strong>Adventure Activities:</strong></h3>\nNepal is a hub of adventure activities, including white water rafting, bungee jumping, paragliding, and mountain biking. If you are an adrenaline junkie, Nepal is the perfect destination.\n<h2><strong>Nepal Tour Cost from Kolkata in 2023\n</strong></h2>\nThe Nepal tour cost from Kolkata in 2023 will depend on various factors, such as the mode of transportation, the type of accommodation, and the duration of the trip. Here is a rough estimate of the cost of a 5-day trip to Nepal from<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\"> Kolkata</a>:\n<h3><strong>Transportation:</strong></h3>\nThe cost of airfare from Kolkata to Kathmandu varies depending on the airline and the time of the year. On average, you can expect to pay around affordable for a round-trip ticket. If you prefer to travel by road, you can take a bus from Kolkata to Nepalgunj, which is very pocket friendly.\n<h3><strong>Accommodation:</strong></h3>\nThe accommodation cost in Nepal varies depending on the type of accommodation you choose. A budget hotel or guesthouse can cost anywhere affordable while a mid-range hotel is also budget-friendly.\n<h3><strong>Food:</strong></h3>\nThe cost of food in Nepal is relatively cheap. A meal at a local restaurant can cost anywhere affordable, while a meal at a mid-range restaurant can also be budget-friendly.\n<h3><strong>Sightseeing:</strong></h3>\nThe cost of sightseeing in Nepal varies depending on the places you visit. The entrance fee to popular tourist attractions such as Pashupatinath Temple, Boudhanath Stupa, and Swayambhunath Stupa is also budget-friendly.\n<h2></h2>\n<h2><strong>Why is a Nepal Tour from Kolkata is Affordable?\n</strong></h2>\nCompared to other popular tourist destinations, Nepal is still relatively affordable. The cost of living in Nepal is lower than in most Western countries, which means you can stretch your budget further.\n\nIn addition, Nepal offers a range of budget-friendly accommodation options, from hostels to guesthouses. This means you can find a comfortable place to stay without breaking the bank.\n\nFurthermore, the cost of food in Nepal is also affordable, and you can find delicious meals for a fraction of the cost.\n\n<a href=\"https://travlio.in/\"><strong>Travlio’s</strong></a> carefully curated tour packages, you can sit back, relax, and let us take care of all the planning and logistics, while you focus on making memories that will last a lifetime.','Nepal Tour Cost from Kolkata in 2023.','','publish','open','open','','nepal-tour-cost-from-kolkata-2023','','','2023-04-12 12:37:47','2023-04-12 12:37:47','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7722',0,'post','',0),
(7725,1,'2023-04-13 07:19:23','2023-04-13 07:19:23','<h2><b>Travlio : </b><b>Honeymoon tour packages from Kolkata</b><b> : </b></h2>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Are you getting married in Kolkata and looking for the perfect honeymoon destination? Look no further! Travlio has put together a list of the best </span><a href=\"https://travlio.in/travlio-domestic-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\"><b>honeymoon tour packages from Kolkata</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in 2023. We\'ve got you covered whether you seek a romantic beach getaway or an adventurous mountain retreat. Read on for our top picks.</span>\n<h3><b>Andaman and Nicobar Islands Honeymoon Package from Kolkata :</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Andaman and Nicobar Islands are the perfect honeymoon destination for couples looking for a tropical paradise. With crystal-clear waters, pristine beaches, and stunning coral reefs, this destination offers endless opportunities for relaxation and adventure. The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Honeymoon Package from Travelio includes flights from Kolkata to Port Blair, accommodation in a luxurious beach resort, and a full-day tour of the islands. Spend your days lounging on the beach, snorkelling in the coral reefs, and exploring the local culture and cuisine.</span>\n<h3><b>Darjeeling Gangtok Honeymoon Tour Package from Kolkata :</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\'re looking for a romantic mountain getaway, the Darjeeling Gangtok Honeymoon Tour is the perfect choice. This tour takes you through the stunning hills of Darjeeling and Gangtok, where you can enjoy the breathtaking views of the Himalayas and explore the local culture and cuisine. The package includes flights from Kolkata to Bagdogra, accommodation in luxurious mountain resorts, and a full-day tour of Darjeeling and Gangtok. Spend your days sipping tea in the tea gardens, visiting Buddhist monasteries, and enjoying the stunning views of the Himalayas.</span>\n<h3><b>Kerala Honeymoon Tour Package from Kolkata : </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kerala, also known as \"God\'s Own Country,\" is a popular honeymoon destination for couples looking for a romantic getaway. The Kerala Honeymoon Tour from Travelio takes you through the backwaters, beaches, and hill stations of this beautiful state. The package includes flights from Kolkata to Kochi, accommodation in luxurious resorts, and a full-day tour of Kochi, Alleppey, Munnar, and Thekkady. Spend your days cruising the backwaters, strolling along the beaches, and exploring the hill stations.</span>\n<h3><b>Bali Honeymoon Package from Kolkata : </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bali is a popular honeymoon destination for couples looking for a romantic and exotic getaway. The Bali Honeymoon Package from Travelio includes flights from Kolkata to Denpasar, accommodation in luxurious beach resorts, and a full-day tour of the island. Spend your days lounging on the beach, exploring the local culture and cuisine, and enjoying the stunning natural beauty of the island. While in Bali, indulge yourself and your partner with a relaxing massage, as the region also has a reputation for its spa treatments.</span>\n<h3><b>Mauritius Honeymoon Package from Kolkata : </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mauritius is renowned for its pristine beaches, crystal-clear waters, and stunning natural beauty. Travlio\'s Mauritius Honeymoon Package includes flights from Kolkata, luxurious beach resort accommodation, and a full-day island tour. Spend your days lounging on the beach, snorkelling in the coral reefs, and exploring the local culture and cuisine.</span>\n<h3><b>Singapore Malaysia Honeymoon Package from Kolkata : </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For a honeymoon with a blend of adventure and relaxation, choose the Singapore Malaysia Honeymoon Package. This package includes flights from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a> to Singapore, accommodation in luxurious hotels, and a full-day tour of Singapore and Malaysia. Explore Singapore\'s Gardens by the Bay and Zoo, then visit Malaysia for the stunning Batu Caves and Petronas Towers.</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choosing the perfect honeymoon destination can be a daunting task, but with </span><a href=\"https://travlio.in/\"><b>Travlio\'s</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> list of the best </span><a href=\"https://travlio.in/international-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\"><b>honeymoon tour packages from Kolkata</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in 2023.</span>','Best Honeymoon Tour Packages from Kolkata in 2023','','publish','open','open','','best-honeymoon-tour-packages-from-kolkata-2023','','','2023-04-13 07:19:23','2023-04-13 07:19:23','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7725',0,'post','',0),
(7732,1,'2023-04-13 07:40:14','2023-04-13 07:40:14','<h2><b>Travlio :</b> <b>Tour packages from Kolkata</b><b> : </b></h2>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kolkata, the cultural capital of India, is a city steeped in history, art, and culture. Known for its colonial architecture, delicious cuisine, and bustling streets, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\">Kolkata</a> is a must-visit destination for anyone looking to explore the diverse and vibrant culture of India. With a plethora of attractions and experiences on offer, planning a trip to Kolkata can be overwhelming. That’s where Travlio comes in - we’ve curated a list of the top </span><b>tour packages from Kolkata</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in 2023, to make your trip planning a breeze.</span>\n<h3><b>Sunderbans Wildlife Tour packages from Kolkata: </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Located just a few hours away from Kolkata, Sunderbans is a UNESCO World Heritage site and one of the largest mangrove forests in the world. Home to the Royal Bengal Tiger, as well as a wide variety of other flora and fauna, the Sundarbans is a nature lover’s paradise. Travlio’s Sunderbans Wildlife Tour is a 3-day package that includes a guided tour of the mangrove forest, a visit to the crocodile breeding centre, and a boat ride through the dense network of creeks and canals that crisscross the forest.</span>\n<h3><b>Darjeeling Gangtok Tour packages from Kolkata: </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nestled in the foothills of the Himalayas, Darjeeling and Gangtok are two of the most picturesque destinations in India. Travlio’s Darjeeling Gangtok Tour is a 5-day package that includes a visit to the famous tea gardens of Darjeeling, a ride on the Darjeeling Himalayan Railway (also known as the Toy Train), a visit to the Tsomgo Lake in Gangtok, and a cable car ride over the lush green valleys of the region.</span>\n<h3><b>Kolkata City Tour packages from Kolkata: </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For those who want to explore the city of Kolkata itself, Travlio’s Kolkata City Tour is the perfect package. This 2-day tour includes visits to the iconic Victoria Memorial, the historic St. Paul’s Cathedral, and the bustling markets of New Market and Gariahat. The tour also includes a ride on the iconic yellow Ambassador taxis of Kolkata, a unique experience in itself.</span>\n<h3><b>Sundarban Delta Cruise Tour packages from Kolkata: </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you’re looking for a more leisurely way to explore the Sunderbans, Travlio’s Sundarban Delta Cruise is the perfect option. This 4-day cruise takes you on a journey through the dense mangrove forests of the Sundarbans, with stops at various islands and villages along the way. You’ll also have the opportunity to spot the elusive Royal Bengal Tiger, as well as other wildlife such as crocodiles, deer, and birds.</span>\n<h3><b>Puri and Bhubaneswar Tour packages from Kolkata : </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Located in the neighbouring state of Odisha, Puri and Bhubaneswar are two of the most important pilgrimage destinations in India. Travlio’s Puri and Bhubaneswar Tour is a 4-day package that includes a visit to the famous Jagannath Temple in Puri, as well as the ancient temples of Bhubaneswar. You’ll also get to explore the stunning beaches of Puri and sample the delicious local cuisine.</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether you’re a nature lover, a history buff, or simply looking to explore the vibrant culture of India, Kolkata and its neighbouring destinations offer something for everyone. With </span><a href=\"https://travlio.in/\"><b>Travlio’s</b></a> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">carefully curated tour packages, you can sit back, relax, and let us take care of all the planning and logistics, while you focus on making memories that will last a lifetime.</span>','Top tour packages from Kolkata in 2023','','publish','open','open','','top-tour-packages-from-kolkata-in-2023','','','2023-04-13 07:40:14','2023-04-13 07:40:14','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7732',0,'post','',0),
(7735,1,'2023-04-13 07:56:48','2023-04-13 07:56:48','<h2><b>Travlio : </b><b>Holiday packages from kolkat</b><b>a</b><b> : </b></h2>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kolkata, the city of joy, is a bustling metropolis located in eastern India. With its rich history, vibrant culture, and delicious food, it has become a popular tourist destination. If you\'re planning a trip from Kolkata in 2023, Travlio has put together a guide to the best </span><a href=\"https://travlio.in/travlio-domestic-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\"><b>holiday packages from Kolkata</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to make your planning process easier. Whether you\'re looking for a peaceful retreat or an adventurous trip, we have something for everyone.</span>\n<h3><b>Darjeeling and Gangtok Holiday Tour Packages from Kolkata :</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Darjeeling and Gangtok are two of the most popular hill stations in India, and with good reason. With their stunning views of the Himalayas, tea gardens, and monasteries, they offer a unique experience for travellers. This package includes a visit to Darjeeling\'s iconic Tiger Hill, where you can catch a breathtaking sunrise over the Kanchenjunga range. You\'ll also get to explore Gangtok\'s scenic beauty and learn about its Buddhist heritage.</span>\n<h3><b>Sundarbans Holiday Tour Packages from Kolkata:</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\'re a nature lover, then the Sundarbans tour is perfect for you. The Sundarbans is the largest mangrove forest in the world and a UNESCO World Heritage Site. This package includes a cruise through the mangrove forests, where you\'ll get to spot the Royal Bengal Tiger, saltwater crocodiles, and a variety of bird species. You\'ll also get to visit the local villages and interact with the locals to learn about their way of life.</span>\n<h3><b>Andaman and Nicobar Holiday Tour Packages from Kolkata: </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Andaman and Nicobar Islands are a group of islands located in the Bay of Bengal. Known for their pristine beaches, crystal clear waters, and exotic marine life, they are a paradise for beach lovers and adventure seekers. This package includes a visit to the iconic Cellular Jail, also known as Kala Pani, where you can learn about the Indian freedom struggle. You\'ll also get to explore the beautiful beaches of Havelock Island and Neil Island and indulge in water sports like snorkelling and scuba diving.</span>\n<h3><b>Bhutan Holiday Tour Packages from Kolkata: </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bhutan, also known as the Land of the Thunder Dragon, is a small Himalayan kingdom known for its unique culture and stunning landscapes. This package includes a visit to the capital city of Thimphu, where you can visit the Memorial Chorten and the National Library. You\'ll also get to visit the iconic Tiger\'s Nest Monastery, which is perched on a cliff at an altitude of 3,120 metres above sea level. The package also includes a visit to the Punakha Dzong, one of the most beautiful dzongs in Bhutan.</span>\n<h3><b>Kerala Holiday Tour Packages from Kolkata:</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kerala, also known as God\'s Own Country, is a state located in southern India known for its backwaters, beaches, and serene landscapes. This package includes a visit to the famous backwaters of Alleppey, where you can cruise through the canals and soak in the beautiful scenery. You\'ll also get to visit the historic city of Kochi and the tea gardens of Munnar. The package also includes a visit to the famous Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary, where you can spot elephants, tigers, and other wildlife species.</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kolkata is a gateway to some of the most beautiful destinations in India, and </span><a href=\"https://travlio.in/\"><b>Travlio</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> has curated some of the </span><a href=\"https://travlio.in/international-tour-packages-from-kolkata/\"><b>best holiday packages from Kolkata</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for you to choose from. Whether you\'re looking for a peaceful retreat, an adventurous trip, or a cultural experience, we have something for everyone. So why wait? Book your trip today and create memories that will last a lifetime.</span>','Guide to the Best Holiday Packages from Kolkata in 2023','','publish','open','open','','travelers-guide-to-the-best-holiday-packages-from-kolkata-in-2023','','','2023-04-13 07:56:48','2023-04-13 07:56:48','',0,'https://travlio.in/?p=7735',0,'post','',0),
