(7745,1,'2023-04-13 09:25:44','2023-04-13 09:25:44','<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gujarat, a land of vibrant culture and heritage, is one of the most sought-after tourist destinations in India. From its fascinating history and architecture to its diverse wildlife and scenic beauty, Gujarat offers a unique travel experience for tourists from all over the world. And if you are a resident of<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkata\"> Kolkata</a> planning a trip to Gujarat in 2023, then Travlio has got you covered with its best Gujarat tour packages from Kolkata.</span>\n<h2><b>Travlio</b><b> : </b><b>Best Gujarat tour packages from Kolkata</b><b> : </b></h2>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In this blog, we will take a closer look at the </span><b>best Gujarat tour packages from Kolkata</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in 2023 offered by Travlio. So, let\'s dive in.</span>\n<h3><b>Gujarat Heritage Tour packages:</b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are a history buff, then the Gujarat Heritage Tour is a must-have experience for you. This package covers the historical landmarks of Gujarat, including the ancient city of Dwarka, the Sun Temple at Modhera, and the Rani ki Vav stepwell. You will also get to witness the magnificent architecture of the Somnath Temple, the Champaner-Pavagadh Archaeological Park, and the UNESCO World Heritage Site of the city of Ahmedabad. This tour will take you back in time and give you a glimpse of Gujarat\'s rich cultural heritage.</span>\n<h3><b>Gujarat Wildlife Tour packages: </b></h3>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For wildlife enthusiasts, the Gujarat Wildlife Tour is the perfect way to explore the diverse wildlife of Gujarat. This package covers the Gir National Park, the only habitat of the Asiatic Lions in the world. You will also get to visit the Blackbuck National Park in Velavadar, where you can spot the Indian antelope in their natural habitat. This tour also includes a visit to the Nalsarovar